/* 前沿 AI 数学：44 个主题和附录 A–L 的正文。中文是讲义原文（PDF 转文字时坏掉的个别符号改了回来，“本书”改成“讲义”），英文是手写的翻译。
   每条：id、part（aim-data.js 的 parts）、kind（演示的身份）、math（aim-data.js 里公式的键）、title / lead / secs / take / src；附录另有 demo（借用哪个主题的演示）。 */
(() => {
  'use strict';
  const D = window.MOLASTRIA_AIM;
  if (!D) return;
  D.topics.push(
    {"id":"01","part":"lang","kind":"construct","math":["t01a","t01b"],"title":{"zh":"表征：把对象放进几何空间","en":"Representations: placing objects in a geometric space"},"lead":{"zh":"神经网络先把语言、图像、分子等对象表示成向量，再用可学习的变换重塑空间。距离和方向是否有意义，取决于训练目标与所用度量。","en":"A neural network first represents language, images, molecules and other objects as vectors, then reshapes the space with learnable transformations. Whether distances and directions mean anything depends on the training objective and on the metric in use."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"从欧氏距离到学习度量","en":"From Euclidean distance to a learned metric"},"p":{"zh":"若 M=LᵀL，则马氏距离就是先变换 x↦Lx，再测普通欧氏距离。M 正定时是度量；仅半正定时，不同点可能距离为零。图中同一组点经线性变换后，原本不明显的方向被放大。","en":"If M=LᵀL, the Mahalanobis distance is the ordinary Euclidean distance measured after the map x↦Lx. When M is positive definite it is a metric; when it is only positive semidefinite, distinct points can be at distance zero. In the demo the same points pass through a linear map, and a direction that was barely visible is stretched out."}},{"h":{"zh":"模型在学什么","en":"What the model is learning"},"p":{"zh":"线性层改变坐标和尺度，非线性层允许空间弯曲。词向量“靠近”表示特定目标下的相似性，不自动表示逻辑等价、因果关系或物理接近。","en":"Linear layers change coordinates and scales; nonlinear layers let the space bend. Word vectors being “close” expresses similarity under a particular objective. It does not automatically express logical equivalence, a causal relation or physical proximity."}},{"h":{"zh":"研究连接","en":"Research connections"},"p":{"zh":"对比学习、检索、度量学习与表征坍缩，都可以问同一个问题：哪些方向被保留，哪些被压平？高维可视化降到二维后，还必须检查距离失真。","en":"Contrastive learning, retrieval, metric learning and representation collapse can all be asked the same question: which directions are kept, and which are flattened? After a high-dimensional picture has been reduced to two dimensions, the distortion of distances must still be checked."}}],"take":{"zh":"先明确空间、内积和不变性，再解释一张嵌入散点图。","en":"State the space, the inner product and the invariances first; only then interpret a scatter plot of embeddings."},"src":{"zh":"基础背景 [1]；图为原创教学构造。","en":"Background [1]; the figure is an original teaching construction."}},
    {"id":"02","part":"lang","kind":"analytic","math":["t02a","t02b"],"title":{"zh":"SVD、低秩与 LoRA","en":"SVD, low rank and LoRA"},"lead":{"zh":"奇异值分解把矩阵拆成“旋转 → 各方向缩放 → 旋转”。低秩近似保留最强的若干作用方向；LoRA 则直接限制可训练更新的秩。","en":"The singular value decomposition splits a matrix into “rotate → scale along each direction → rotate”. A low-rank approximation keeps the few strongest directions of action; LoRA instead restricts the rank of the trainable update directly."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"最优近似的条件","en":"The condition for optimal approximation"},"p":{"zh":"奇异值按降序排列。Eckart-Young-Mirsky 结论给出 Frobenius 范数下的最佳秩 r 近似；谱范数误差为 σᵣ₊₁。图展示自行构造矩阵的谱与保留能量。","en":"Singular values are sorted in decreasing order. The Eckart–Young–Mirsky result gives the best rank-r approximation in the Frobenius norm; the error in the spectral norm is σᵣ₊₁. The demo shows the spectrum of a constructed matrix and the energy it retains."}},{"h":{"zh":"从定理到参数效率","en":"From theorem to parameter efficiency"},"p":{"zh":"对 W∈Rᵐˣⁿ，B∈Rᵐˣʳ、A∈Rʳˣⁿ，更新参数从 mn 减到 r(m+n)。例如 m=n=4096、r=16，仅占全矩阵参数的 0.78125%。","en":"For W∈Rᵐˣⁿ with B∈Rᵐˣʳ and A∈Rʳˣⁿ, the parameters of the update drop from mn to r(m+n). With m=n=4096 and r=16, for example, that is only 0.78125% of the full matrix."}},{"h":{"zh":"不能偷换的结论","en":"Conclusions that must not be swapped"},"p":{"zh":"LoRA 学的是任务更新 ΔW，不是每一步都对完整 W 做截断 SVD。更新低秩是否足够是任务假设；多个层的低秩更新经过非线性组合仍可产生复杂函数变化。","en":"LoRA learns a task update ΔW; it does not truncate the SVD of the full W at every step. Whether a low-rank update suffices is an assumption about the task; low-rank updates in several layers, composed through nonlinearities, can still change the function in complicated ways."}}],"take":{"zh":"区分“矩阵本身低秩”“更新低秩”与“数据位于低维流形”。","en":"Keep apart “the matrix itself has low rank”, “the update has low rank” and “the data lie on a low-dimensional manifold”."},"src":{"zh":"[2]","en":"[2]"}},
    {"id":"03","part":"lang","kind":"analytic","math":["t03a","t03b"],"title":{"zh":"反向传播是伴随链式法则","en":"Backpropagation is the adjoint chain rule"},"lead":{"zh":"前向计算保存中间状态；反向计算把损失对输出的敏感性逐层拉回。它精确计算程序的导数，不等于用有限差分逐个扰动参数。","en":"The forward pass stores intermediate states; the backward pass pulls the sensitivity of the loss to the output back through the layers. It computes the derivative of the program exactly, which is not the same as perturbing parameters one by one with finite differences."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"推导主线","en":"The main line of the derivation"},"p":{"zh":"由微分 dL=h̄ₗ₊₁ᵀ dhₗ₊₁，代入 dhₗ₊₁=Jₕ dhₗ+Jθ dθₗ，比较 dhₗ 与 dθₗ 的系数，即得两条反向式。这里上横线表示伴随量，不是平均值。","en":"Start from the differential dL=h̄ₗ₊₁ᵀ dhₗ₊₁, substitute dhₗ₊₁=Jₕ dhₗ+Jθ dθₗ, and compare the coefficients of dhₗ and dθₗ: the two backward formulas follow. The bar denotes an adjoint quantity here, not a mean."}},{"h":{"zh":"为什么便宜","en":"Why it is cheap"},"p":{"zh":"标量损失、海量参数时，反向模式一次遍历就得到所有参数梯度；正向模式更适合少量输入方向的 JVP。完整 Jacobian 通常既不需要，也存不下。","en":"With a scalar loss and a huge number of parameters, reverse mode obtains every parameter gradient in one sweep; forward mode suits JVPs along a few input directions. The full Jacobian is usually neither needed nor storable."}},{"h":{"zh":"进阶问题","en":"Further questions"},"p":{"zh":"深层网络连乘 Jacobian 会放大或压小某些方向。残差、归一化和谱约束都在管理这一传播。checkpointing 以重复计算换显存；非光滑点按实现选用次梯度。","en":"In a deep network the product of Jacobians amplifies some directions and shrinks others. Residual connections, normalisation and spectral constraints all manage this propagation. Checkpointing trades recomputation for memory; at non-smooth points the implementation picks a subgradient."}}],"take":{"zh":"VJP 用于训练梯度；JVP 用于方向导数、动力学与 MeanFlow。","en":"VJPs give training gradients; JVPs give directional derivatives, dynamics and MeanFlow."},"src":{"zh":"基础背景 [1]；MeanFlow 连接见 [19]。","en":"Background [1]; for the link to MeanFlow see [19]."}},
    {"id":"04","part":"lang","kind":"analytic","math":["t04a","t04b"],"title":{"zh":"概率：学习条件分布","en":"Probability: learning conditional distributions"},"lead":{"zh":"同一输入可能对应多个合理输出。概率模型描述这种不确定性；期望把随机损失变成可优化的标量。先分清数据随机性、参数不确定性与抽样误差。","en":"One input can have several reasonable outputs. A probabilistic model describes that uncertainty; the expectation turns a random loss into a scalar that can be optimised. First tell apart randomness in the data, uncertainty about parameters, and sampling error."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"贝叶斯更新","en":"Bayesian updating"},"p":{"zh":"先验乘似然，再除以证据进行归一化。图用伯努利实验的 Beta 先验演示：观察 8 次成功、2 次失败后，Beta(2,2) 变为 Beta(10,4)。这只是教学数据。","en":"Prior times likelihood, divided by the evidence to normalise. The demo uses a Beta prior for a Bernoulli experiment: after 8 successes and 2 failures, Beta(2,2) becomes Beta(10,4). These are teaching data only."}},{"h":{"zh":"Monte Carlo 与小批量","en":"Monte Carlo and mini-batches"},"p":{"zh":"独立同分布样本均值的标准误差按 n⁻¹ᐟ² 下降；样本强相关时，实际有效样本量更小。随机梯度以有限样本近似总体梯度，还需满足可交换求导与积分的条件。","en":"The standard error of the mean of i.i.d. samples falls as n⁻¹ᐟ²; when samples are strongly correlated the effective sample size is smaller. A stochastic gradient approximates the population gradient from finitely many samples, and the conditions for exchanging differentiation and integration must also hold."}},{"h":{"zh":"条件期望的几何","en":"The geometry of conditional expectation"},"p":{"zh":"E[Y|X] 是平方可积随机变量空间中，将 Y 投影到“只依赖 X 的函数”上的正交投影。这个事实将直接推出噪声预测、流匹配与回归的最优解。","en":"E[Y|X] is the orthogonal projection of Y, in the space of square-integrable random variables, onto the functions that depend on X alone. This one fact yields the optimal solutions of noise prediction, flow matching and regression directly."}}],"take":{"zh":"条件期望不是一句抽象定义，它是生成模型平方损失背后的统一答案。","en":"Conditional expectation is not just an abstract definition: it is the single answer behind the squared losses of generative models."},"src":{"zh":"原创例子；基础背景 [1]。","en":"Original example; background [1]."}},
    {"id":"05","part":"lang","kind":"analytic","math":["t05a","t05b"],"title":{"zh":"信息论：交叉熵为何有效","en":"Information theory: why cross-entropy works"},"lead":{"zh":"负对数概率同时是编码长度和预测惩罚。最大似然训练希望为真实样本分配更大概率；从总体看，它在减少模型与数据分布之间的 KL 差异。","en":"A negative log-probability is at once a code length and a penalty on a prediction. Maximum-likelihood training tries to give real samples more probability; at the population level it reduces the KL divergence between the data distribution and the model."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"从样本到分布","en":"From samples to distributions"},"p":{"zh":"训练集平均负对数似然估计交叉熵。H(p) 不依赖模型参数，所以最小化交叉熵等价于最小化正向 KL。要求 p 有质量处 q>0；否则 KL 可为无穷。","en":"The average negative log-likelihood on the training set estimates the cross-entropy. H(p) does not depend on the model parameters, so minimising cross-entropy is equivalent to minimising the forward KL. This requires q>0 wherever p has mass; otherwise the KL can be infinite."}},{"h":{"zh":"方向不同，行为不同","en":"A different direction, a different behaviour"},"p":{"zh":"图比较双峰目标 p 与两个高斯候选 q。正向 KL 对漏掉真实质量惩罚大；反向 KL 对在低 p 区域放质量惩罚大。“覆盖模式／追逐模式”是受模型族约束时的典型倾向，不是普适定理。","en":"The demo compares a bimodal target p with Gaussian candidates q. The forward KL penalises missing real mass heavily; the reverse KL penalises putting mass where p is low. “Mode covering / mode seeking” is the typical tendency when the model family is constrained, not a universal theorem."}},{"h":{"zh":"语言模型的读数","en":"Reading a language model"},"p":{"zh":"使用自然对数时，困惑度为 exp(平均 token NLL)。分词器、测试语料和上下文设置不同，困惑度不能直接横比；更低 NLL 也不保证更可靠的事实陈述。","en":"With natural logarithms, perplexity is exp(mean NLL per token). With a different tokeniser, test corpus or context setting, perplexities cannot be compared directly; a lower NLL does not guarantee more reliable factual statements either."}}],"take":{"zh":"KL 不对称、不是距离；训练目标的方向会改变最优近似。","en":"KL is asymmetric and is not a distance; the direction of the training objective changes the best approximation."},"src":{"zh":"基础背景 [1]；所有密度均为教学分布。","en":"Background [1]; all densities are teaching distributions."}},
    {"id":"06","part":"lang","kind":"numeric","math":["t06a","t06b"],"title":{"zh":"高维：集中、尺度与有效维度","en":"High dimensions: concentration, scale and effective dimension"},"lead":{"zh":"高维高斯的大部分质量不在原点附近，而在半径约 √d 的薄壳中。许多深度学习缩放因子来自这种统计结构。","en":"Most of the mass of a high-dimensional Gaussian is not near the origin but in a thin shell of radius about √d. Many scaling factors in deep learning come from this statistical structure."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"薄壳为什么出现","en":"Why the thin shell appears"},"p":{"zh":"d 个独立平方项相加，均值增长为 d、标准差只增长为 √(2d)，因此相对波动下降。图显示不同维数下 ||X||/√d 的 Monte Carlo 直方图。","en":"Adding d independent squared terms, the mean grows as d while the standard deviation grows only as √(2d), so the relative fluctuation falls. The demo shows Monte Carlo histograms of ||X||/√d in different dimensions."}},{"h":{"zh":"注意力缩放的假设","en":"The assumption behind attention scaling"},"p":{"zh":"第二式假设 q、k 的各分量独立、零均值、单位方差，且两向量相互独立。真实网络并不完全满足，但该估算解释了为何点积需要尺度控制。","en":"The second formula assumes the components of q and k are independent with zero mean and unit variance, and that the two vectors are independent of each other. Real networks do not satisfy this exactly, but the estimate explains why the dot product needs its scale controlled."}},{"h":{"zh":"维度灾难与结构","en":"The curse of dimensionality, and structure"},"p":{"zh":"均匀网格每维放 m 点，总量 mᵈ；函数若受低维结构、局部性或对称性约束，则可能避开最坏情况。二维投影的簇不能直接证明高维空间中可分。","en":"A uniform grid with m points per axis has mᵈ points in all; a function constrained by low-dimensional structure, locality or symmetry may escape the worst case. Clusters in a two-dimensional projection do not directly prove separability in the high-dimensional space."}}],"take":{"zh":"高维既带来指数复杂性，也带来集中规律；模型依靠结构而不是消灭维度。","en":"High dimension brings exponential complexity and also laws of concentration; models rely on structure, they do not abolish dimension."},"src":{"zh":"这个主题为直接概率计算与原创模拟。","en":"This topic is direct probability calculation and original simulation."}},
    {"id":"07","part":"opt","kind":"analytic","math":["t07a","t07b"],"title":{"zh":"曲率、SGD 与 AdamW","en":"Curvature, SGD and AdamW"},"lead":{"zh":"梯度指出局部下降方向，曲率决定同样大小的步子会发生什么。优化困难常来自方向尺度差异，而不是“有很多局部极小值”这一句话。","en":"The gradient points in the direction of local descent; curvature decides what a step of a given size will do. Optimisation is often hard because directions differ in scale, not because of the one-liner “there are many local minima”."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"二次模型给出边界","en":"The quadratic model gives the bound"},"p":{"zh":"对正定二次损失，固定步长梯度下降要求 0<η<2/λmax(H)。条件数 κ=λmax/λmin 大时，窄谷导致振荡与缓慢前进。图用同一个二次函数比较普通梯度与理想预条件。","en":"For a positive definite quadratic loss, gradient descent with a fixed step needs 0<η<2/λmax(H). When the condition number κ=λmax/λmin is large, the narrow valley causes oscillation and slow progress. The demo compares plain gradient descent with an ideal preconditioner on the same quadratic."}},{"h":{"zh":"Adam 的状态","en":"The state Adam keeps"},"p":{"zh":"mₜ=β₁mₜ₋₁+(1−β₁)gₜ；vₜ=β₂vₜ₋₁+(1−β₂)gₜ²，逐元素运算。偏差校正为 m̂ₜ=mₜ/(1−β₁ᵗ)、v̂ₜ=vₜ/(1−β₂ᵗ)。AdamW 的权重衰减与自适应梯度更新分开。","en":"mₜ=β₁mₜ₋₁+(1−β₁)gₜ and vₜ=β₂vₜ₋₁+(1−β₂)gₜ², element by element. The bias corrections are m̂ₜ=mₜ/(1−β₁ᵗ) and v̂ₜ=vₜ/(1−β₂ᵗ). In AdamW the weight decay is separated from the adaptive gradient update."}},{"h":{"zh":"适用边界","en":"Limits of validity"},"p":{"zh":"Adam 的 v 不是 Hessian，也不自动等于 Fisher。随机梯度噪声、学习率计划、权重衰减和参数化共同影响结果，不能从一个二维谷底图推断大模型排名。","en":"Adam’s v is not the Hessian, nor is it automatically the Fisher matrix. Gradient noise, the learning-rate schedule, weight decay and the parametrisation all shape the outcome; a picture of a two-dimensional valley cannot rank optimisers for large models."}}],"take":{"zh":"优化器是在选择“按什么几何尺度走一步”。图不是优化器性能基准。","en":"An optimiser chooses “in which geometry to measure one step”. The figure is not a benchmark of optimisers."},"src":{"zh":"[3,4]","en":"[3,4]"}},
    {"id":"08","part":"opt","kind":"analytic","math":["t08a","t08b","t08c"],"title":{"zh":"自然梯度与 Fisher 信息","en":"The natural gradient and Fisher information"},"lead":{"zh":"参数移动一厘米没有坐标无关的意义；预测分布改变多少更有意义。自然梯度用局部 KL 距离来测量步长。","en":"Moving a parameter by one centimetre has no coordinate-free meaning; how much the predictive distribution changes does. The natural gradient measures step length by the local KL divergence."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"推导","en":"Derivation"},"p":{"zh":"在分布正规、支撑不随参数变化且可交换微分与积分时，score 的期望为零。对 KL 做二阶展开得到 F。再最小化 gᵀΔ，约束 ΔᵀFΔ/2≤δ，用拉格朗日乘子求解即得自然梯度。","en":"When the distribution is regular, its support does not move with the parameters, and differentiation and integration can be exchanged, the score has zero expectation. Expanding the KL to second order gives F. Minimising gᵀΔ subject to ΔᵀFΔ/2≤δ with a Lagrange multiplier then gives the natural gradient."}},{"h":{"zh":"计算近似","en":"Approximations in practice"},"p":{"zh":"大网络无法存储完整 F，实践使用对角、块结构或 Kronecker 近似。F 奇异时需伪逆或阻尼 F+λI；阻尼改善数值稳定，但会改变精确的坐标不变性。","en":"A large network cannot store the full F; practice uses diagonal, block or Kronecker approximations. When F is singular a pseudo-inverse or damping F+λI is needed; damping improves numerical stability but changes the exact coordinate invariance."}},{"h":{"zh":"与策略优化的联系","en":"The link to policy optimisation"},"p":{"zh":"TRPO 的局部 KL 约束具有这种几何解释；PPO 的裁剪只是方便的代理目标，不能保证真正满足逐次 KL 上界。","en":"The local KL constraint of TRPO has this geometric reading; PPO’s clipping is only a convenient surrogate and cannot guarantee a KL bound at every update."}}],"take":{"zh":"“小参数变化”与“小行为变化”是两种不同的约束。完整推导见附录 A。","en":"“A small change of parameters” and “a small change of behaviour” are two different constraints. The full derivation is in Appendix A."},"src":{"zh":"[5,23]","en":"[5,23]"}},
    {"id":"09","part":"opt","kind":"analytic","math":["t09a","t09b"],"title":{"zh":"Muon：从奇异谱看更新","en":"Muon: updates seen through their singular spectrum"},"lead":{"zh":"对矩阵梯度使用整体几何，而不只逐元素缩放，是近期优化器研究的一条路线。Muon 的关键对象是动量矩阵的近似极分解。","en":"Using the geometry of the whole gradient matrix, rather than rescaling entry by entry, is one line of recent optimiser research. The key object in Muon is an approximate polar decomposition of the momentum matrix."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"为什么出现 UVᵀ","en":"Why UVᵀ appears"},"p":{"zh":"谱范数球与核范数互为对偶：最小目标值为 −η||M||*。在紧致 SVD 的非零奇异子空间上，将每个奇异值换成 1 就达到该值。秩亏时解可不唯一。","en":"The spectral-norm ball and the nuclear norm are dual: the minimum of the objective is −η||M||*. On the subspace of non-zero singular values of the compact SVD, replacing every singular value by 1 attains it. When the rank is deficient the solution need not be unique."}},{"h":{"zh":"算法与理想式的区别","en":"The algorithm versus the ideal formula"},"p":{"zh":"实际 Muon 常用有限次 Newton-Schulz 型多项式迭代近似正交化，并配合动量、矩阵形状缩放及衰减。图展示理想极因子的谱；不是声称实际更新严格所有奇异值为 1。","en":"Actual Muon commonly approximates the orthogonalisation with a finite number of Newton–Schulz-type polynomial iterations, together with momentum, scaling by matrix shape, and decay. The demo shows the spectrum of the ideal polar factor; it does not claim that a real update has all singular values exactly equal to 1."}},{"h":{"zh":"论文与问题","en":"Papers and questions"},"p":{"zh":"2025 年的扩展研究给出大规模语言模型实验。其经验收益依赖架构、预算和参数组；非矩阵参数的处理也需明确。开放问题是谱平坦化何时帮助特征学习，何时放大无用方向。","en":"The 2025 follow-up study reports experiments on large language models. Its empirical gains depend on architecture, budget and parameter group; how non-matrix parameters are handled must be stated too. The open question is when flattening the spectrum helps feature learning and when it amplifies useless directions."}}],"take":{"zh":"Muon 改变的是更新矩阵的奇异谱，不是在训练后强制所有权重正交。","en":"Muon changes the singular spectrum of the update matrix; it does not force the weights to be orthogonal after training."},"src":{"zh":"[6]","en":"[6]"}},
    {"id":"10","part":"seq","kind":"construct","math":["t10a","t10b"],"title":{"zh":"Transformer 的数学骨架","en":"The mathematical skeleton of the Transformer"},"lead":{"zh":"一次前向传播把离散 token 变成上下文相关表征，再给出下一个 token 的概率。架构负责表示函数，交叉熵负责规定学习方向。","en":"One forward pass turns discrete tokens into context-dependent representations and then into a probability for the next token. The architecture supplies the function; the cross-entropy says in which direction to learn."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"从 token 到条件概率","en":"From tokens to conditional probability"},"p":{"zh":"词表索引查嵌入表后得到 n×d 矩阵；多头注意力交换序列位置的信息；逐位置 MLP 改造特征；输出线性层与 softmax 得到词表分布。图画的是常见 pre-norm 变体。","en":"Vocabulary indices look up an embedding table to give an n×d matrix; multi-head attention exchanges information between positions; a position-wise MLP transforms features; an output linear layer and a softmax give a distribution over the vocabulary. The diagram shows the common pre-norm variant."}},{"h":{"zh":"训练与生成","en":"Training and generation"},"p":{"zh":"因果掩码让位置 i 只看 ≤i 的信息，整条训练序列可以并行计算损失。生成时逐 token 使用已生成前缀，KV cache 避免重复计算旧键值，但缓存随上下文增长。","en":"The causal mask lets position i see only information at positions ≤i, so the loss for a whole training sequence is computed in parallel. Generation uses the prefix produced so far, token by token; a KV cache avoids recomputing old keys and values, but the cache grows with the context."}},{"h":{"zh":"函数组合的视角","en":"The view as a composition of functions"},"p":{"zh":"模型容量不仅由参数量决定，还取决于深度、宽度、非线性、位置机制和数据。注意力矩阵并非完整的因果解释，因为后续层、值向量与残差也共同决定输出。","en":"Capacity is set not only by the number of parameters but also by depth, width, nonlinearity, the positional mechanism and the data. An attention matrix is not a complete causal explanation, because later layers, the value vectors and the residual stream also determine the output."}}],"take":{"zh":"训练并行不意味着自回归生成也能一次并行完成整段文本。","en":"Parallel training does not mean that autoregressive generation can produce a whole passage in one parallel step."},"src":{"zh":"[7]","en":"[7]"}},
    {"id":"11","part":"seq","kind":"analytic","math":["t11a","t11b"],"title":{"zh":"注意力：可微检索与加权平均","en":"Attention: differentiable retrieval and weighted averaging"},"lead":{"zh":"每个 query 给各个 key 打分，softmax 把分数变成权重，再对 value 做加权平均。机制本身简单，复杂性来自学出的查询与多层组合。","en":"Each query scores every key, a softmax turns the scores into weights, and the values are averaged with those weights. The mechanism itself is simple; the complexity comes from the learned queries and from composing many layers."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"手算一个 query","en":"One query by hand"},"p":{"zh":"取 q=(1,0)，键为 (1,0)、(0,1)、(1,1)，则缩放分数约为 (0.707,0,0.707)，权重约 (0.401,0.198,0.401)。若值是 (1,0)、(0,2)、(1,1)，输出约为 (0.802,0.797)。","en":"Take q=(1,0) and keys (1,0), (0,1), (1,1): the scaled scores are about (0.707, 0, 0.707) and the weights about (0.401, 0.198, 0.401). If the values are (1,0), (0,2), (1,1), the output is about (0.802, 0.797)."}},{"h":{"zh":"为什么能训练","en":"Why it can be trained"},"p":{"zh":"softmax Jacobian 为 diag(a)−aaᵀ，行和为零；整体平移所有 logits 不改变概率。低温可让注意力更尖锐，但也可能造成梯度饱和。完整矩阵梯度在附录 B。","en":"The Jacobian of the softmax is diag(a)−aaᵀ, with zero row sums; shifting all logits together leaves the probabilities unchanged. A low temperature sharpens attention but can also saturate the gradients. The full matrix gradient is in Appendix B."}},{"h":{"zh":"复杂度与实现","en":"Complexity and implementation"},"p":{"zh":"显式注意力权重需 O(n²) 存储，主要计算量为 O(n²d)。FlashAttention 通过分块和在线 softmax 减少显存读写，通常保持精确注意力语义，并不把所有算术复杂度变成 O(n)。","en":"Explicit attention weights need O(n²) storage, and the main computation is O(n²d). FlashAttention reduces memory traffic by tiling and an online softmax; it normally keeps the semantics of exact attention and does not turn all the arithmetic into O(n)."}}],"take":{"zh":"图中颜色是人为设置的示例权重，不是对真实大模型注意力的测量。","en":"The colours in the figure are example weights set by hand, not a measurement of attention in a real large model."},"src":{"zh":"[7,8]","en":"[7,8]"}},
    {"id":"12","part":"seq","kind":"analytic","math":["t12a","t12b"],"title":{"zh":"RoPE：把相对位置写进内积","en":"RoPE: writing relative position into the inner product"},"lead":{"zh":"旋转位置编码将每对通道看成二维平面。位置控制旋转角，因此两位置的点积自然依赖角度差。","en":"Rotary position embedding treats each pair of channels as a two-dimensional plane. Position controls the angle of rotation, so the dot product of two positions depends naturally on the difference of angles."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"两步推导","en":"A two-step derivation"},"p":{"zh":"旋转矩阵正交，所以 R(mω)ᵀ=R(−mω)；同一平面旋转可相加，因此 R(−mω)R(nω)=R((n−m)ω)。多维 RoPE 用不同频率的二维块拼起来。","en":"A rotation matrix is orthogonal, so R(mω)ᵀ=R(−mω); rotations in the same plane add, so R(−mω)R(nω)=R((n−m)ω). Multi-dimensional RoPE assembles two-dimensional blocks with different frequencies."}},{"h":{"zh":"频率视角","en":"The frequency view"},"p":{"zh":"低频通道缓慢变化，高频通道区分局部位置。它与 Fourier 特征共享“用周期基编码坐标”的思想，但注意力权重还依赖内容向量，并非单纯位置核。","en":"Low-frequency channels vary slowly; high-frequency channels separate nearby positions. RoPE shares with Fourier features the idea of encoding coordinates in a periodic basis, but the attention weight also depends on the content vectors and is not a pure position kernel."}},{"h":{"zh":"长上下文边界","en":"The limit at long context"},"p":{"zh":"数学上可为任何位置计算旋转，不等于训练外长度自动泛化。频率重标定、插值与训练长度分布会影响表现；周期混叠与注意力尺度也是实际问题。","en":"That the rotation can be computed for any position does not mean automatic generalisation to lengths beyond training. Frequency rescaling, interpolation and the distribution of training lengths affect behaviour; periodic aliasing and the scale of attention are practical problems too."}}],"take":{"zh":"能计算到更远的位置，和能可靠理解更长的上下文，是不同问题。","en":"Being able to compute a farther position and being able to understand a longer context reliably are different problems."},"src":{"zh":"[9]","en":"[9]"}},
    {"id":"13","part":"seq","kind":"construct","math":["t13a","t13b"],"title":{"zh":"残差、谱稳定性与 mHC","en":"Residuals, spectral stability and mHC"},"lead":{"zh":"残差路径提供近似恒等的信息通道。扩展为多条残差流后，需要约束跨流混合，避免反复相乘造成无控制的放大。","en":"The residual path provides a near-identity channel for information. Once it is widened to several residual streams, the mixing across streams has to be constrained, or repeated multiplication amplifies without control."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"双随机矩阵的意义","en":"What a doubly stochastic matrix means"},"p":{"zh":"行和、列和均为 1。由 Birkhoff-von Neumann 定理，P 是置换矩阵的凸组合；每个置换矩阵的谱范数为 1，再用范数凸性得到非扩张性。这样的矩阵相乘仍双随机。","en":"Its row sums and column sums are all 1. By the Birkhoff–von Neumann theorem, P is a convex combination of permutation matrices; each permutation matrix has spectral norm 1, and convexity of the norm then gives non-expansiveness. Products of such matrices are again doubly stochastic."}},{"h":{"zh":"连接到近期架构","en":"The link to a recent architecture"},"p":{"zh":"mHC（2025 年末提出，2026 年修订）对多残差流的混合引入双随机约束，并用 Sinkhorn 归一化近似实现。图显示同一方向在无约束放大与双随机混合下的变化。","en":"mHC (proposed at the end of 2025, revised in 2026) imposes a doubly stochastic constraint on the mixing of several residual streams and realises it approximately by Sinkhorn normalisation. The demo shows what happens to one vector under unconstrained amplification and under doubly stochastic mixing."}},{"h":{"zh":"必须保留的限制","en":"Limits that must be kept"},"p":{"zh":"约束保护的是该混合算子，不代表整个非线性网络的 Jacobian 都不放大，也不保证不丢信息。Birkhoff 集是多面体，边界有角；“manifold”是论文命名，不能无条件当作处处光滑流形。","en":"The constraint protects that mixing operator; it does not mean the Jacobian of the whole nonlinear network never amplifies, nor that no information is lost. The Birkhoff set is a polytope with corners on its boundary; “manifold” is the paper’s name and cannot be taken unconditionally to mean a manifold that is smooth everywhere."}}],"take":{"zh":"稳定性结论必须对应到具体算子，不能从一个局部约束推广到整个模型。","en":"A stability statement must be attached to a specific operator; it cannot be extended from one local constraint to the whole model."},"src":{"zh":"[10]","en":"[10]"}},
    {"id":"14","part":"seq","kind":"analytic","math":["t14a","t14b"],"title":{"zh":"SSM：用状态压缩历史","en":"SSMs: compressing history into a state"},"lead":{"zh":"状态空间模型把过去信息递归存入固定维状态；注意力直接寻址历史位置。两者在某些结构下可用同一个下三角矩阵描述。","en":"A state-space model stores the past recursively in a state of fixed dimension; attention addresses past positions directly. Under certain structures both can be described by the same lower-triangular matrix."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"展开递推就是矩阵","en":"Unrolling the recursion gives a matrix"},"p":{"zh":"把 hₜ₋₁ 不断代回，得到对全部历史输入的加权和。权重具有由状态递推产生的结构，能用扫描算法计算，而无需显式存 n×n 的所有元素。","en":"Substituting hₜ₋₁ back repeatedly gives a weighted sum over all past inputs. The weights have a structure produced by the state recursion, and can be computed by a scan without storing all n×n entries explicitly."}},{"h":{"zh":"从连续到离散","en":"From continuous to discrete"},"p":{"zh":"对时间不变系统 dh/dt=Ah+Bx，零阶保持离散化给出 Ā=exp(AΔ)，B̄=∫₀^Δ exp(As)B ds。A 可逆时 B̄=A⁻¹(Ā−I)B；不可逆时应使用积分式。","en":"For a time-invariant system dh/dt=Ah+Bx, zero-order-hold discretisation gives Ā=exp(AΔ) and B̄=∫₀^Δ exp(As)B ds. When A is invertible B̄=A⁻¹(Ā−I)B; when it is not, the integral form should be used."}},{"h":{"zh":"Mamba-2 的联系","en":"The link to Mamba-2"},"p":{"zh":"结构化状态空间对偶把某些 SSM 与结构化注意力联系起来，不能理解为任意 softmax Transformer 都等于同一个固定状态递推。压缩记忆、精确检索与硬件效率之间仍有取舍。","en":"Structured state-space duality connects certain SSMs with structured attention; it does not mean that any softmax Transformer equals one fixed state recursion. Compressed memory, exact retrieval and hardware efficiency still trade off against each other."}}],"take":{"zh":"关键是历史交互矩阵的结构，不是简单把 O(n²) 标签换成 O(n)。","en":"What matters is the structure of the matrix of interactions with history, not swapping the label O(n²) for O(n)."},"src":{"zh":"[11]","en":"[11]"}},
    {"id":"15","part":"seq","kind":"construct","math":["t15a","t15b"],"title":{"zh":"MoE：条件计算与负载分配","en":"MoE: conditional computation and load allocation"},"lead":{"zh":"混合专家让不同 token 激活不同子网络。它扩大总参数容量，同时限制单 token 的激活计算；路由和通信成为新的瓶颈。","en":"A mixture of experts lets different tokens activate different sub-networks. It enlarges total parameter capacity while limiting the computation activated per token; routing and communication become the new bottleneck."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"概率混合与实际网络","en":"Probabilistic mixture versus the actual network"},"p":{"zh":"上式是采用 top-k 后重新归一化的一种典型实现；不同架构可能采用 sigmoid 门控、共享专家或其他缩放。专家输出是向量函数，不必是概率分布。","en":"The formula is one typical implementation, with top-k selection followed by renormalisation; other architectures use sigmoid gates, shared experts or other scalings. An expert’s output is a vector-valued function and need not be a probability distribution."}},{"h":{"zh":"负载为什么不均","en":"Why the load is uneven"},"p":{"zh":"被选中的专家获得更多训练信号，容易形成正反馈，使部分专家过载、部分闲置。可用辅助损失或动态路由偏置调节负载，但具体规则会改变优化过程。","en":"Experts that are selected receive more training signal, which easily creates positive feedback: some experts are overloaded and some idle. An auxiliary loss or a dynamic routing bias can adjust the load, but the particular rule changes the optimisation."}},{"h":{"zh":"规模的三本账","en":"Three separate accounts of scale"},"p":{"zh":"必须分别报告总参数、每 token 激活参数和实际 FLOPs／通信／延迟。稀疏激活不代表模型能全部塞进小显存；未激活权重也需要存储或搬运。图为设定的路由示意。","en":"Total parameters, parameters activated per token, and actual FLOPs / communication / latency must be reported separately. Sparse activation does not mean the whole model fits in a small memory; weights that are not activated still have to be stored or moved. The figure is a routing set by hand."}}],"take":{"zh":"MoE 的数学是稀疏条件计算；系统收益还取决于路由分布与通信。","en":"The mathematics of MoE is sparse conditional computation; the system-level gain also depends on the routing distribution and on communication."},"src":{"zh":"[12]","en":"[12]"}},
    {"id":"16","part":"seq","kind":"construct","math":["t16a","t16b"],"title":{"zh":"多模态：对比学习与温度","en":"Multimodal learning: contrastive loss and temperature"},"lead":{"zh":"图像与文本来自不同观测空间，却可被编码到共享空间。对比损失提升匹配对的相似度，并压低同批次不匹配对的相对分数。","en":"Images and text come from different observation spaces yet can be encoded into a shared one. The contrastive loss raises the similarity of matched pairs and lowers the relative scores of unmatched pairs in the same batch."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"从分类理解","en":"Reading it as classification"},"p":{"zh":"把“哪段文字匹配这张图”当作一个批内分类问题。对称版本还反过来用文字检索图像。梯度将正对拉近、负对推远；图中的理想对角结构由教学向量计算。","en":"Treat “which text matches this image” as a classification problem within the batch. The symmetric version also retrieves images from text. The gradient pulls positive pairs together and pushes negatives apart; the ideal diagonal structure in the demo is computed from teaching vectors."}},{"h":{"zh":"温度和负例","en":"Temperature and negatives"},"p":{"zh":"τ 小使分布更尖锐，也放大梯度尺度；批量、难负例和错误负例都会改变学习信号。两张不同图片可能表达同一概念，将它们强当负例可能损伤表示。","en":"A small τ sharpens the distribution and also enlarges the scale of the gradients; batch size, hard negatives and false negatives all change the learning signal. Two different pictures may express the same concept, and forcing them to be negatives can damage the representation."}},{"h":{"zh":"信息论联系的边界","en":"The limits of the information-theoretic link"},"p":{"zh":"InfoNCE 在特定联合采样、独立负例和评分条件下给出互信息下界，但不能把每个实用对比损失数值都解释为真实语义互信息。共享嵌入也不是跨模态因果理解的证明。","en":"Under particular conditions on joint sampling, independent negatives and the score function, InfoNCE gives a lower bound on mutual information; but the numerical value of every practical contrastive loss cannot be read as true semantic mutual information. A shared embedding is not proof of cross-modal causal understanding either."}}],"take":{"zh":"温度决定竞争强度；采样方式决定“相似”究竟指什么。","en":"Temperature sets how hard the competition is; the sampling scheme decides what “similar” actually means."},"src":{"zh":"[13,14]","en":"[13,14]"}},
    {"id":"17","part":"gen","kind":"construct","math":["t17a","t17b"],"title":{"zh":"三条路：似然、潜变量与运输","en":"Three routes: likelihood, latent variables and transport"},"lead":{"zh":"生成不是把训练样本简单拼接。数学上可以分解联合概率、引入潜变量，或者把简单分布通过确定性／随机动力学搬运到数据分布。","en":"Generation is not stitching training samples together. Mathematically one can factorise the joint probability, introduce latent variables, or carry a simple distribution to the data distribution by deterministic or stochastic dynamics."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"自回归","en":"Autoregression"},"p":{"zh":"概率链式法则始终成立，建模误差来自条件分布的参数化与训练。离散语言中这条路线非常自然，但按此因子分解采样通常要顺序生成。","en":"The chain rule of probability always holds; modelling error comes from the parametrisation and training of the conditional distributions. For discrete language this route is very natural, but sampling by this factorisation usually has to proceed in order."}},{"h":{"zh":"潜变量与可逆流","en":"Latent variables and invertible flows"},"p":{"zh":"潜变量模型允许多对一映射，积分通常难算；可逆流要求维数匹配与可逆性，通过 Jacobian 行列式精确跟踪体积变化。VAE 则用变分推断处理后验。","en":"Latent-variable models allow many-to-one maps, and the integral is usually intractable; invertible flows require matching dimensions and invertibility, and track changes of volume exactly through the Jacobian determinant. A VAE instead handles the posterior by variational inference."}},{"h":{"zh":"连续时间统一","en":"Unification in continuous time"},"p":{"zh":"ODE 流搬运粒子，SDE 同时加入扩散。扩散模型、流匹配与一致性模型常共享相关概率路径，但训练目标、边界约定、求解方式并不完全相同。","en":"An ODE flow carries particles; an SDE adds diffusion as well. Diffusion models, flow matching and consistency models often share related probability paths, but their training objectives, boundary conventions and solvers are not all the same."}}],"take":{"zh":"先问模型如何定义概率或概率路径，再问它如何训练、如何采样。","en":"First ask how a model defines a probability or a probability path; then ask how it is trained and how it is sampled."},"src":{"zh":"[15,16,17,18]","en":"[15,16,17,18]"}},
    {"id":"18","part":"gen","kind":"analytic","math":["t18a","t18b","t18c"],"title":{"zh":"VAE：变分下界与重参数化","en":"VAE: the variational bound and reparametrisation"},"lead":{"zh":"真实后验 pθ(z|x) 难算时，用 qφ(z|x) 近似。ELBO 同时奖励重建能力，并约束潜变量分布偏离先验的程度。","en":"When the true posterior pθ(z|x) is intractable it is approximated by qφ(z|x). The ELBO rewards reconstruction and at the same time limits how far the latent distribution strays from the prior."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"下界从哪里来","en":"Where the bound comes from"},"p":{"zh":"把 log pθ(x,z)−log qφ(z|x) 对 q 取期望，利用联合分布＝后验×证据展开，即得第一式。KL 非负，故 ELBO≤log pθ(x)。完整代数见附录 C。","en":"Take the expectation of log pθ(x,z)−log qφ(z|x) under q and expand using joint = posterior × evidence: this gives the first formula. KL is non-negative, hence ELBO≤log pθ(x). The full algebra is in Appendix C."}},{"h":{"zh":"为何能对随机采样求导","en":"Why one can differentiate through sampling"},"p":{"zh":"将参数依赖移到确定性映射 μ+σ⊙ε 中，固定噪声分布后可用路径导数。离散潜变量不能直接照搬这一高斯重参数化。","en":"The dependence on the parameters is moved into the deterministic map μ+σ⊙ε; with the noise distribution fixed, a pathwise derivative can be used. Discrete latent variables cannot simply copy this Gaussian reparametrisation."}},{"h":{"zh":"研究边界","en":"Research limits"},"p":{"zh":"解码器过强、KL 权重或优化失衡可导致后验坍缩：z 几乎不携带 x 信息。β-VAE 改变 KL 权重后，一般不再等于原始模型的标准证据下界优化。","en":"A decoder that is too strong, or an imbalance in the KL weight or in optimisation, can cause posterior collapse: z carries almost no information about x. Once β-VAE changes the KL weight, the objective is in general no longer the standard evidence lower bound of the original model."}}],"take":{"zh":"“下界变高”与“真实似然等量变高”只有在后验近似间隙受控时才接近。","en":"“The bound went up” and “the true likelihood went up by the same amount” are close only when the gap of the posterior approximation is under control."},"src":{"zh":"[15]","en":"[15]"}},
    {"id":"19","part":"gen","kind":"construct","math":["t19a","t19b"],"title":{"zh":"离散扩散：语言不只一种顺序","en":"Discrete diffusion: language has more than one order"},"lead":{"zh":"对文本可以逐步随机遮住 token，再学习恢复被遮位置。离散状态空间不能直接照搬连续高斯噪声公式；掩码过程需要自己的转移核和损失权重。","en":"Text can be corrupted by masking tokens at random, step by step, and a model can learn to restore the masked positions. A discrete state space cannot simply reuse the formulas of continuous Gaussian noise; the masking process needs its own transition kernel and loss weights."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"读懂这个特例","en":"Reading this special case"},"p":{"zh":"t∈(0,1] 为独立掩码概率，M 是吸收掩码 token。1/t 权重属于这一时间参数化的典型连续时间目标；不能把任意遮挡重建损失都叫同一个似然下界。","en":"t∈(0,1] is the independent masking probability and M is the absorbing mask token. The weight 1/t belongs to a typical continuous-time objective under this parametrisation of time; not every mask-and-reconstruct loss can be called the same likelihood bound."}},{"h":{"zh":"生成方式","en":"How generation proceeds"},"p":{"zh":"从全掩码或部分掩码开始，多轮预测并逐步确定内容；实现可以按置信度挑位置，也可采用分块生成。每轮并行预测不意味着所有 token 的联合分布可以独立一次抽完。","en":"Starting from a fully or partly masked sequence, the model predicts over several rounds and fixes the content gradually; an implementation may pick positions by confidence or generate in blocks. Predicting in parallel within a round does not mean the joint distribution of all tokens can be sampled independently in one shot."}},{"h":{"zh":"前沿联系","en":"The link to the frontier"},"p":{"zh":"LLaDA 给出大规模离散扩散语言建模的实例。研究问题包括 KV cache、生成长度、训练与采样分布失配，以及速度与全局一致性的平衡。图展示机制，不给出性能排名。","en":"LLaDA is an example of discrete-diffusion language modelling at scale. Research questions include the KV cache, generation length, the mismatch between training and sampling distributions, and the balance between speed and global consistency. The demo shows the mechanism and gives no performance ranking."}}],"take":{"zh":"自回归、掩码扩散可以共享 Transformer，差别首先在概率过程与训练目标。","en":"Autoregression and masked diffusion can share a Transformer; they differ first in the probabilistic process and the training objective."},"src":{"zh":"[20]","en":"[20]"}},
    {"id":"20","part":"gen","kind":"construct","math":["t20a","t20b","t20c"],"title":{"zh":"DDPM：加噪为何有闭式","en":"DDPM: why adding noise has a closed form"},"lead":{"zh":"这个主题采用“数据 t=0，噪声 t=T”的时间方向。线性高斯转移可逐步合并，因此训练时能直接跳到任意噪声水平，不必先模拟全部前向步骤。","en":"This topic uses the time direction “data at t=0, noise at t=T”. Linear Gaussian transitions compose step by step, so training can jump straight to any noise level without simulating all the forward steps first."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"闭式的归纳","en":"The induction behind the closed form"},"p":{"zh":"若 xₜ₋₁ 的信号系数为 √ᾱₜ₋₁，再乘 √αₜ 得 √ᾱₜ。独立高斯噪声的方差相加为 αₜ(1−ᾱₜ₋₁)+βₜ=1−ᾱₜ。图用双团二维样本显示前向加噪。","en":"If xₜ₋₁ has signal coefficient √ᾱₜ₋₁, multiplying by √αₜ gives √ᾱₜ. The variances of independent Gaussian noise add: αₜ(1−ᾱₜ₋₁)+βₜ=1−ᾱₜ. The demo shows forward noising of two-dimensional samples from two clusters."}},{"h":{"zh":"训练目标的含义","en":"What the training objective means"},"p":{"zh":"网络看到污染后的样本和时间，预测所加噪声。简化的均方误差通常改变严格变分界中的时间权重；它非常实用，但不应与完整 ELBO 完全等同。","en":"The network sees the corrupted sample and the time, and predicts the noise that was added. The simplified mean squared error usually changes the time weighting of the strict variational bound; it is very practical but should not be equated with the full ELBO."}},{"h":{"zh":"有限时间的限制","en":"The limit of finite time"},"p":{"zh":"只有 ᾱT 足够接近 0 时，终态才近似标准高斯。模型误差、噪声日程、离散步数和解码器误差会共同影响最终质量。","en":"The terminal state is close to a standard Gaussian only when ᾱT is close enough to 0. Model error, the noise schedule, the number of discrete steps and decoder error jointly affect the final quality."}}],"take":{"zh":"加噪有解析式；去噪需要学习条件统计，而不是把原来那份随机噪声直接减回去。","en":"Adding noise has an analytic formula; removing it requires learning conditional statistics, not subtracting the original random noise back out."},"src":{"zh":"[17]","en":"[17]"}},
    {"id":"21","part":"gen","kind":"analytic","math":["t21a","t21b"],"title":{"zh":"Score：密度的局部方向场","en":"The score: a local direction field of the density"},"lead":{"zh":"Score 是对样本坐标求的对数密度梯度。它不需要归一化常数，并把概率分布转化为一个指向高密度区域的向量场。","en":"The score is the gradient of the log-density with respect to the sample coordinates. It needs no normalising constant, and it turns a probability distribution into a vector field pointing towards regions of high density."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"从高斯条件核推出","en":"Deriving it from the Gaussian conditional kernel"},"p":{"zh":"对 pₜ(x)=∫p(x|x₀)p₀(x₀)dx₀ 求导，再除以 pₜ(x)。高斯核的 score 为 −(x−aₜx₀)/σₜ²，条件期望即得上式。要求 σₜ>0 和合法的积分微分交换。","en":"Differentiate pₜ(x)=∫p(x|x₀)p₀(x₀)dx₀ and divide by pₜ(x). The score of the Gaussian kernel is −(x−aₜx₀)/σₜ², and taking the conditional expectation gives the formula above. This requires σₜ>0 and a legitimate exchange of integral and derivative."}},{"h":{"zh":"与噪声回归连接","en":"The link to noise regression"},"p":{"zh":"平方损失的最优预测为 ε*(x,t)=E[ε|xₜ=x]，所以 s*=−ε*/σₜ。网络不是必然恢复某个训练样本的精确噪声，而是在相同观测下求条件平均。","en":"The optimal prediction under squared loss is ε*(x,t)=E[ε|xₜ=x], so s*=−ε*/σₜ. The network does not necessarily recover the exact noise of some training sample; it takes a conditional average over everything consistent with the same observation."}},{"h":{"zh":"直观的陷阱","en":"An intuitive trap"},"p":{"zh":"双峰密度的两峰之间可能有 score=0 的低密度不稳定点。因此只沿 score 确定性爬坡不是完整的分布采样算法；要配合时间变化或随机动力学。","en":"Between the two peaks of a bimodal density there can be an unstable low-density point where the score is 0. So climbing the score deterministically is not a complete algorithm for sampling the distribution; it has to be combined with a changing time or with stochastic dynamics."}}],"take":{"zh":"score 是 ∇ₓ log p，不是模型评分，也不是 ∇θ log p。","en":"The score is ∇ₓ log p. It is not a model’s rating, and it is not ∇θ log p."},"src":{"zh":"[18]；恒等式详见附录 D。","en":"[18]; the identity is derived in Appendix D."}},
    {"id":"22","part":"gen","kind":"numeric","math":["t22a","t22b","t22c"],"title":{"zh":"SDE、Fokker–Planck 与反演","en":"SDEs, Fokker–Planck and time reversal"},"lead":{"zh":"扩散过程把粒子轨迹与密度演化连接起来。下式假设扩散系数 g 只依赖时间；若它还依赖空间，反向漂移需要额外散度项。","en":"A diffusion process connects particle trajectories with the evolution of a density. The formulas below assume the diffusion coefficient g depends on time only; if it also depends on space, the reverse drift needs an extra divergence term."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"符号约定最重要","en":"The sign convention matters most"},"p":{"zh":"第二式沿 t 递减积分，dt 为负。若换用正向反时钟 τ=T−t，漂移变为 −f+g²s，布朗噪声按 τ 增长。两种写法不能混用。","en":"The second formula integrates with t decreasing, so dt is negative. With the forward-running reverse clock τ=T−t, the drift becomes −f+g²s and the Brownian noise grows with τ. The two ways of writing must not be mixed."}},{"h":{"zh":"为何 ODE 只有一半","en":"Why the ODE has only half"},"p":{"zh":"把 v=f−g²∇log p/2 代入连续性方程 −∇·(vp)，利用 p∇log p=∇p，就得到同一 Fokker-Planck 方程。因此精确 score 下两过程共享各时刻边缘分布。","en":"Substitute v=f−g²∇log p/2 into the continuity equation −∇·(vp) and use p∇log p=∇p: the same Fokker–Planck equation results. With the exact score, therefore, the two processes share their marginal distribution at every time."}},{"h":{"zh":"相同边缘不等于相同路径","en":"Same marginals do not mean same paths"},"p":{"zh":"SDE 路径随机且通常不可微，ODE 路径确定性且在适当条件下可微。实际网络 score 有误差时，二者不再保证给出完全相同的分布。","en":"SDE paths are random and usually non-differentiable; ODE paths are deterministic and, under suitable conditions, differentiable. When the network’s score has error, the two are no longer guaranteed to give exactly the same distribution."}}],"take":{"zh":"反向 SDE、概率流 ODE 与训练目标是三个层次，先统一时间方向。","en":"The reverse SDE, the probability flow ODE and the training objective are three levels; fix the direction of time first."},"src":{"zh":"[18]；推导见附录 E。","en":"[18]; the derivation is in Appendix E."}},
    {"id":"23","part":"gen","kind":"analytic","math":["t23a","t23b","t23c"],"title":{"zh":"连续性方程与 CNF","en":"The continuity equation and CNFs"},"lead":{"zh":"现在改用“噪声 t=0，数据 t=1”。一个速度场搬运粒子；概率质量守恒决定密度如何变化。散度衡量局部体积的膨胀与收缩。","en":"From here on the convention is “noise at t=0, data at t=1”. A velocity field carries particles; conservation of probability mass decides how the density changes. The divergence measures local expansion and contraction of volume."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"沿轨迹求全导数","en":"The total derivative along a trajectory"},"p":{"zh":"d log p(Xₜ)/dt=∂ₜlog p+v·∇log p。将连续性方程展开成 ∂ₜp=−v·∇p−p∇·v，两项抵消后只剩负散度。","en":"d log p(Xₜ)/dt=∂ₜlog p+v·∇log p. Expanding the continuity equation as ∂ₜp=−v·∇p−p∇·v, two terms cancel and only the negative divergence remains."}},{"h":{"zh":"如何计算迹","en":"How the trace is computed"},"p":{"zh":"Hutchinson 估计用 E[εᵀJv ε]=tr(Jv)，只需 E[εεᵀ]=I。JVP／VJP 可避免显式构建 d×d Jacobian，但有限随机探针会带来估计方差。","en":"The Hutchinson estimator uses E[εᵀJv ε]=tr(Jv), which needs only E[εεᵀ]=I. JVPs / VJPs avoid building the d×d Jacobian explicitly, but a finite number of random probes brings estimation variance."}},{"h":{"zh":"存在唯一性的条件","en":"Conditions for existence and uniqueness"},"p":{"zh":"空间 Lipschitz 等条件保证 ODE 解的唯一性和流映射的良好性质。有限时间、光滑可逆 ODE 无法把满维连续分布精确压成低维奇异分布；实际常有去量化或末端近似。","en":"Conditions such as spatial Lipschitz continuity guarantee uniqueness of the ODE solution and good properties of the flow map. A smooth invertible ODE over finite time cannot compress a full-dimensional continuous distribution exactly onto a lower-dimensional singular one; in practice there is dequantisation or an approximation at the end."}}],"take":{"zh":"速度场决定粒子怎么走，散度决定沿途密度怎么变。","en":"The velocity field decides how particles move; the divergence decides how the density changes along the way."},"src":{"zh":"[16,21]","en":"[16,21]"}},
    {"id":"24","part":"gen","kind":"analytic","math":["t24a","t24b"],"title":{"zh":"Flow Matching：监督速度场","en":"Flow matching: supervising a velocity field"},"lead":{"zh":"训练时构造容易采样的插值路径，并知道每条路径的瞬时速度。网络只看到当前位置和时间，通过平方回归学到边缘分布的正确速度。","en":"During training one builds interpolation paths that are easy to sample and whose instantaneous velocity is known. The network sees only the current position and time, and learns the correct velocity of the marginal distribution by squared-error regression."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"关键并非记住配对","en":"The point is not to memorise the pairing"},"p":{"zh":"同一位置和时间可能来自许多不同端点配对。条件期望把相互竞争的速度平均起来。图同时画出样本直线插值与回归得到的边缘速度概念。","en":"The same position and time can come from many different pairs of endpoints. The conditional expectation averages the competing velocities. The demo draws both the straight-line interpolations of samples and the marginal velocity that regression yields."}},{"h":{"zh":"为什么得到正确概率路径","en":"Why the probability path comes out right"},"p":{"zh":"对任意光滑测试函数 φ，有 dEφ(Xₜ)/dt=E[∇φ(Xₜ)·U]=E[∇φ(Xₜ)·v*(Xₜ,t)]，这正是连续性方程的弱形式。平方回归分解见附录 F。","en":"For any smooth test function φ, dEφ(Xₜ)/dt=E[∇φ(Xₜ)·U]=E[∇φ(Xₜ)·v*(Xₜ,t)], which is exactly the weak form of the continuity equation. The decomposition of the squared regression is in Appendix F."}},{"h":{"zh":"训练和采样分开","en":"Training and sampling are separate"},"p":{"zh":"训练只需抽 t、端点并算一次网络，通常不必求解 ODE；采样仍需沿学习到的场积分。样本配对的直线路径不意味着学出的边缘 ODE 每条轨迹都直。","en":"Training only needs to draw t and the endpoints and evaluate the network once, usually with no ODE solve; sampling still integrates along the learned field. Straight paths between paired samples do not mean every trajectory of the learned marginal ODE is straight."}}],"take":{"zh":"simulation-free 指常见 FM 训练无需模拟整条轨迹，不代表生成不需要积分。","en":"Simulation-free means that common FM training need not simulate whole trajectories; it does not mean generation needs no integration."},"src":{"zh":"[21,22]","en":"[21,22]"}},
    {"id":"25","part":"gen","kind":"analytic","math":["t25a","t25b","t25c"],"title":{"zh":"可算到底的高斯流","en":"A Gaussian flow that can be computed to the end"},"lead":{"zh":"取独立 X₀∼N(0,1)、X₁∼N(2,0.25)，并做线性插值。这个例子让分布、条件速度和最终 ODE 解都可解析计算。","en":"Take independent X₀∼N(0,1) and X₁∼N(2,0.25) and interpolate linearly. In this example the distributions, the conditional velocity and the final ODE solution can all be computed in closed form."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"从联合高斯求条件均值","en":"The conditional mean of a joint Gaussian"},"p":{"zh":"U=X₁−X₀ 的均值为 2；Cov(U,Xₜ)=−(1−t)+0.25t。联合高斯的条件均值为 E[U]+Cov(U,Xₜ)Var(Xₜ)⁻¹(x−E[Xₜ])，代入即得速度。","en":"U=X₁−X₀ has mean 2, and Cov(U,Xₜ)=−(1−t)+0.25t. The conditional mean of a joint Gaussian is E[U]+Cov(U,Xₜ)Var(Xₜ)⁻¹(x−E[Xₜ]); substituting gives the velocity."}},{"h":{"zh":"检查解析解","en":"Checking the analytic solution"},"p":{"zh":"对 2t+√aₜZ 求导得到 2+a′ₜZ/(2√aₜ)，而 a′ₜ/2=−1+1.25t，恰与速度式相同。t=1 时 X₁=2+0.5Z，目标分布正确。","en":"Differentiating 2t+√aₜZ gives 2+a′ₜZ/(2√aₜ), and a′ₜ/2=−1+1.25t, exactly the velocity formula. At t=1, X₁=2+0.5Z, the correct target distribution."}},{"h":{"zh":"最值得注意的现象","en":"The most notable phenomenon"},"p":{"zh":"训练路径每条都直，但边缘 ODE 的轨迹一般弯曲；标准差先降到约 0.447（t=0.8），再升到 0.5。这说明独立耦合可能先过度收缩再展开。","en":"Every training path is straight, yet the trajectories of the marginal ODE are generally curved; the standard deviation first falls to about 0.447 (at t=0.8) and then rises to 0.5. This shows that an independent coupling can over-contract first and expand afterwards."}}],"take":{"zh":"这是一组精确解析结果；后文将用它检查数值积分误差。","en":"These are exact analytic results; a later topic uses them to check the error of numerical integration."},"src":{"zh":"原创推导，基于 [21] 的条件流框架。","en":"Original derivation, based on the conditional-flow framework of [21]."}},
    {"id":"26","part":"gen","kind":"analytic","math":["t26a","t26b","t26c"],"title":{"zh":"最优传输、Sinkhorn 与桥","en":"Optimal transport, Sinkhorn and bridges"},"lead":{"zh":"端点分布相同，配对方式仍有很多。最优传输选择搬运代价最小的耦合；熵正则让耦合更平滑；Schrödinger 桥在路径空间选择最接近参考随机过程的运输。","en":"With the same endpoint distributions there are still many ways to pair points. Optimal transport picks the coupling of least transport cost; entropic regularisation smooths the coupling; the Schrödinger bridge picks, in path space, the transport closest to a reference stochastic process."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"一维高斯的对照","en":"The one-dimensional Gaussian for comparison"},"p":{"zh":"上页目标可用最优映射 T(z)=2+0.5z。位移插值为 Xₜ=2t+(1−0.5t)z，轨迹为直线，标准差不发生过度收缩。此处一维单调映射对平方代价最优。","en":"The target of the previous topic can be reached by the optimal map T(z)=2+0.5z. The displacement interpolation is Xₜ=2t+(1−0.5t)z: straight trajectories, and a standard deviation that never over-contracts. Here the monotone map in one dimension is optimal for the squared cost."}},{"h":{"zh":"Sinkhorn 的代数","en":"The algebra of Sinkhorn"},"p":{"zh":"令 Kᵢⱼ=exp(−Cᵢⱼ/ε)，解形如 diag(u)Kdiag(v)；交替更新 u=a/(Kv)、v=b/(Kᵀu)，除法逐元素进行。ε 很小时要注意下溢，常在 log 域计算。","en":"With Kᵢⱼ=exp(−Cᵢⱼ/ε) the solution has the form diag(u)Kdiag(v); alternate the updates u=a/(Kv) and v=b/(Kᵀu), dividing element by element. When ε is very small beware of underflow; the computation is usually done in the log domain."}},{"h":{"zh":"概念边界","en":"Conceptual limits"},"p":{"zh":"熵正则 OT、动态 Schrödinger 桥和确定性 FM 不完全等价。小噪声极限的联系依赖条件；随机 minibatch OT 配对也不保证得到整个数据分布的全局最优运输。","en":"Entropic OT, the dynamic Schrödinger bridge and deterministic FM are not exactly equivalent. The connection in the small-noise limit depends on conditions; OT pairing within random mini-batches does not guarantee the globally optimal transport of the whole data distribution either."}}],"take":{"zh":"“路径更直”是可研究的几何性质，不是所有 FM 都自动满足的最优性保证。","en":"“Straighter paths” is a geometric property open to study, not an optimality guarantee that every FM satisfies automatically."},"src":{"zh":"[22,28,29]","en":"[22,28,29]"}},
    {"id":"27","part":"gen","kind":"numeric","math":["t27a","t27b"],"title":{"zh":"数值求解：Euler 与 Heun","en":"Numerical solvers: Euler and Heun"},"lead":{"zh":"即便速度场完全正确，有限步数也会造成采样误差。减少网络调用次数时，必须区分数值积分误差与模型本身的误差。","en":"Even with an exactly correct velocity field, a finite number of steps causes sampling error. When reducing the number of network calls, the error of numerical integration must be told apart from the error of the model itself."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"阶数与成本","en":"Order and cost"},"p":{"zh":"在足够光滑、稳定的区间上，Euler 全局误差通常 O(h)，Heun 为 O(h²)。Heun 每步通常需要两次网络评估；比较时应报告 NFE，而不只报步数。","en":"On a sufficiently smooth, stable interval the global error of Euler is usually O(h) and that of Heun O(h²). Heun usually needs two network evaluations per step; comparisons should report NFE, not just the number of steps."}},{"h":{"zh":"讲义的可复现实验","en":"The reproducible experiment of the notes"},"p":{"zh":"对上一节的高斯解析场、同一初值 z=1，计算 4、8、16、32、64 步终点误差。图由实际数值积分得到，并与精确终点 2.5 比较，没有调用任何大模型。","en":"For the analytic Gaussian field of the previous topics and the same initial value z=1, compute the endpoint error for 4, 8, 16, 32 and 64 steps. The figure comes from actual numerical integration, compared with the exact endpoint 2.5; no large model is called."}},{"h":{"zh":"为什么提高阶数也会失败","en":"Why a higher order can still fail"},"p":{"zh":"端点奇异、刚性动力学、低光滑场或模型误差占主导时，理论阶数未必体现为样本质量收益。自适应求解器控制局部误差，也不直接控制感知指标或事实正确率。","en":"When an endpoint is singular, the dynamics are stiff, the field has low smoothness or model error dominates, the theoretical order need not show up as better samples. Adaptive solvers control local error; they do not directly control perceptual metrics or factual accuracy."}}],"take":{"zh":"总误差至少包含：建模／估计误差、优化误差、离散化误差。","en":"The total error contains at least modelling / estimation error, optimisation error and discretisation error."},"src":{"zh":"原创解析场实验；背景 [18,21]。","en":"Original experiment on an analytic field; background [18,21]."}},
    {"id":"28","part":"gen","kind":"analytic","math":["t28a","t28b","t28c"],"title":{"zh":"一致性与 MeanFlow","en":"Consistency and MeanFlow"},"lead":{"zh":"若模型直接学会一段轨迹的终点，或一段时间的平均速度，就可能用很少的评估次数生成。困难从“多步积分”转移到更强的函数学习约束。","en":"If a model learns the endpoint of a stretch of trajectory directly, or the average velocity over an interval, it may generate with very few evaluations. The difficulty moves from “many integration steps” to stronger constraints on the function being learned."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"一致性模型","en":"Consistency models"},"p":{"zh":"这个主题沿用该类论文常见的“0 为数据端”约定。一条轨迹上不同噪声点映射到同一端点；边界条件 f(x,0)=x 防止任意常函数成为无意义解。实际常从小正时间开始。","en":"This topic follows the convention common in those papers, with the data at 0. Different noisy points on one trajectory map to the same endpoint; the boundary condition f(x,0)=x stops an arbitrary constant function from being a meaningless solution. In practice one often starts from a small positive time."}},{"h":{"zh":"MeanFlow 的恒等式","en":"The MeanFlow identity"},"p":{"zh":"由 (t−r)u=∫ᵣᵗv dτ，在 r 固定、zₜ 沿轨迹移动时对 t 求全导数，得到第三式。于是可用 JVP 构造训练目标。反向跳步为 zᵣ=zₜ−(t−r)u。","en":"From (t−r)u=∫ᵣᵗv dτ, take the total derivative in t with r fixed and zₜ moving along the trajectory: the third formula results. A training target can then be built with a JVP. The backward jump is zᵣ=zₜ−(t−r)u."}},{"h":{"zh":"前沿与限制","en":"Frontier and limits"},"p":{"zh":"精确恒等式不保证有限网络、有限优化后的误差为零。一次大跳对场误差更敏感；实际训练使用的 stop-gradient、时间采样和条件速度估计都需要单独分析。","en":"An exact identity does not guarantee zero error for a finite network after finite optimisation. One large jump is more sensitive to errors in the field; the stop-gradient, the time sampling and the conditional-velocity estimate used in real training each need separate analysis."}}],"take":{"zh":"一阶瞬时速度、区间平均速度与端点映射，是三种不同的学习对象。","en":"Instantaneous velocity, average velocity over an interval, and the endpoint map are three different objects to learn."},"src":{"zh":"[19,30]；进一步推导见附录 G。","en":"[19,30]; further derivation in Appendix G."}},
    {"id":"29","part":"gen","kind":"analytic","math":["t29a","t29b","t29c"],"title":{"zh":"条件生成与逆问题","en":"Conditional generation and inverse problems"},"lead":{"zh":"文本提示、类别或测量值都可视为条件 c。条件生成要把先验结构与条件信息合在一起；“引导更强”通常也会改变覆盖范围。","en":"A text prompt, a class label or a measurement can all be regarded as a condition c. Conditional generation has to merge prior structure with the information in the condition; “stronger guidance” usually changes the coverage as well."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"Bayes 的梯度形式","en":"Bayes in gradient form"},"p":{"zh":"对 log p(x|c)=log p(x)+log p(c|x)−log p(c) 求 x 梯度，最后一项消失。扩散中的这些分布必须是相同噪声时间下的量。","en":"Take the x-gradient of log p(x|c)=log p(x)+log p(c|x)−log p(c): the last term vanishes. In diffusion these distributions must all be quantities at the same noise time."}},{"h":{"zh":"CFG 的正确解读","en":"Reading CFG correctly"},"p":{"zh":"这里 w=1 是普通条件 score，w>1 是强化引导。对固定时间、精确 score，线性组合是 pₜ(x|c)ʷpₜ(x)¹⁻ʷ 的对数梯度；跨时间采样不自动对应某个简单终态幂分布。","en":"Here w=1 is the ordinary conditional score and w>1 strengthens the guidance. At a fixed time and with exact scores, the linear combination is the log-gradient of pₜ(x|c)ʷpₜ(x)¹⁻ʷ; sampling across times does not automatically correspond to some simple power distribution at the end."}},{"h":{"zh":"科学逆问题","en":"Scientific inverse problems"},"p":{"zh":"若观测是带噪投影 Ax，可结合观测似然与生成先验求后验样本。将干净数据似然梯度直接当作有噪状态的条件梯度往往只是近似，需要验证偏差与不确定性。","en":"If the observation is a noisy projection Ax, the observation likelihood can be combined with a generative prior to draw posterior samples. Using the likelihood gradient of clean data directly as the conditional gradient of a noisy state is often only an approximation; the bias and the uncertainty need to be verified."}}],"take":{"zh":"引导提高条件服从度的同时，可能降低多样性或放大模型误差。","en":"Guidance raises adherence to the condition, and may at the same time lower diversity or amplify model error."},"src":{"zh":"[18,31]","en":"[18,31]"}},
    {"id":"30","part":"rl","kind":"construct","math":["t30a","t30b"],"title":{"zh":"MDP 与 Bellman 递推","en":"MDPs and the Bellman recursion"},"lead":{"zh":"强化学习研究行动如何改变未来收益。状态、动作、转移、奖励和终止规则共同定义问题；换一个奖励函数，就可能学到不同的行为。","en":"Reinforcement learning studies how actions change future returns. States, actions, transitions, rewards and the termination rule together define the problem; change the reward function and a different behaviour may be learned."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"递推从拆第一步得到","en":"The recursion comes from splitting off the first step"},"p":{"zh":"将回报分成当前奖励与折扣后的后续回报，然后对下一状态和未来动作取条件期望，即得 Bellman 关系。最优算子用 maxₐ 替代策略平均；有界奖励、γ<1 时具有压缩性质。","en":"Split the return into the current reward and the discounted later return, then take the conditional expectation over the next state and future actions: this is the Bellman relation. The optimality operator replaces the policy average by maxₐ; with bounded rewards and γ<1 it is a contraction."}},{"h":{"zh":"语言模型的特例","en":"The special case of a language model"},"p":{"zh":"状态可取当前前缀，动作是下一个 token，转移是追加 token；数学题最终正确性给出终局奖励。有限长度问题可取 γ=1，但必须明确终止与长度约束。","en":"The state can be the current prefix, the action the next token, the transition appending that token; the final correctness of a maths problem gives a terminal reward. A finite-length problem may take γ=1, but termination and the length constraint must be stated."}},{"h":{"zh":"代理与世界模型","en":"Agents and world models"},"p":{"zh":"工具使用、机器人控制通常包含不可完全观测环境，需用历史或信念状态近似状态。学习世界模型后做规划，会额外引入模型误差和规划偏差。","en":"Tool use and robot control usually involve environments that are not fully observable, so the state must be approximated by the history or a belief state. Planning on a learned world model adds model error and planning bias."}}],"take":{"zh":"语言推理是序列决策的一种实例；奖励可验证不代表全部推理过程都正确。","en":"Language reasoning is one instance of sequential decision-making; a verifiable reward does not mean every step of the reasoning is correct."},"src":{"zh":"[24,25]","en":"[24,25]"}},
    {"id":"31","part":"rl","kind":"analytic","math":["t31a","t31b"],"title":{"zh":"策略梯度与基线","en":"Policy gradients and baselines"},"lead":{"zh":"采样本身不可直接对离散动作求普通导数，但可对采样分布的对数概率求导。这个“似然比技巧”让奖励信号能够更新语言策略。","en":"One cannot take an ordinary derivative through the sampling of a discrete action, but one can differentiate the log-probability of the sampling distribution. This “likelihood-ratio trick” lets a reward signal update a language policy."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"第一式的推导","en":"Deriving the first formula"},"p":{"zh":"把梯度移入积分，使用 ∇p=p∇log p。若环境转移不依赖 θ，轨迹对数概率中只有策略项贡献梯度；再利用因果性，过去奖励不影响当前动作梯度。","en":"Move the gradient inside the integral and use ∇p=p∇log p. If the environment’s transitions do not depend on θ, only the policy terms of the trajectory log-probability contribute; then, by causality, past rewards do not affect the gradient of the current action."}},{"h":{"zh":"基线为何不改期望","en":"Why a baseline leaves the expectation unchanged"},"p":{"zh":"Eₐ[∇log π(a|s)b(s)]=b(s)∇Σₐπ(a|s)=0。要求基线不依赖当前抽样动作；计算策略梯度时通常把优势／基线目标视为常量。","en":"Eₐ[∇log π(a|s)b(s)]=b(s)∇Σₐπ(a|s)=0. The baseline must not depend on the action currently sampled; when computing the policy gradient the advantage / baseline target is usually treated as a constant."}},{"h":{"zh":"方差与信用分配","en":"Variance and credit assignment"},"p":{"zh":"终局奖励对所有 token 都回传，信号粗糙且方差可能大。价值函数、优势估计、组内对比和过程奖励是不同的降方差／分配信用手段，也各自引入估计偏差或额外假设。","en":"A terminal reward is passed back to every token, so the signal is coarse and its variance can be large. Value functions, advantage estimates, within-group comparison and process rewards are different ways to reduce variance or assign credit, and each brings its own estimation bias or extra assumptions."}}],"take":{"zh":"基线不会凭空增加信息，它主要改变梯度估计的方差。","en":"A baseline does not add information out of thin air; it mainly changes the variance of the gradient estimate."},"src":{"zh":"[23,24]；推导补充见附录 H。","en":"[23,24]; further derivation in Appendix H."}},
    {"id":"32","part":"rl","kind":"analytic","math":["t32a","t32b"],"title":{"zh":"PPO、GRPO 与可验证奖励","en":"PPO, GRPO and verifiable rewards"},"lead":{"zh":"旧策略生成数据，新策略用概率比重加权。PPO 限制过于激进的改动；GRPO 用同一问题的一组回答构造相对优势。","en":"The old policy generates the data, and the new policy reweights it by a probability ratio. PPO limits overly aggressive changes; GRPO builds a relative advantage from a group of answers to the same question."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"可手算的组内优势","en":"A group advantage you can compute by hand"},"p":{"zh":"奖励取 [1,1,0,0]，用总体标准差 0.5，忽略小 ε，优势为 [1,1,−1,−1]。若全组奖励相同，中心化优势为零；这组样本不提供区分好坏的奖励梯度。","en":"Take rewards [1,1,0,0], use the population standard deviation 0.5 and ignore the small ε: the advantages are [1,1,−1,−1]. If the whole group has the same reward the centred advantage is zero; that group gives no reward gradient telling good from bad."}},{"h":{"zh":"真正的实现更细","en":"Real implementations are finer"},"p":{"zh":"token 级概率比、回答长度归一化、KL 惩罚与采样策略都会影响目标。图画的是 PPO 单样本代理目标和教学奖励组；第二式只是 GRPO 的优势核心，不是完整算法。","en":"Token-level probability ratios, normalisation by answer length, the KL penalty and the sampling strategy all affect the objective. The demo draws the PPO surrogate for a single sample and a teaching group of rewards; the second formula is only the core of GRPO’s advantage, not the full algorithm."}},{"h":{"zh":"研究中的关键限制","en":"Key limits in research"},"p":{"zh":"组均值包含样本自身，标准差也依赖样本；它不是直接满足上一个主题“动作无关基线”的无偏证明。裁剪不保证严格 KL 上界；验证器漏洞、长度偏好和奖励稀疏都可能改变学习结果。","en":"The group mean includes the sample itself, and the standard deviation depends on the samples too; this is not a direct proof of unbiasedness under the “action-independent baseline” of the previous topic. Clipping does not guarantee a strict KL bound; verifier loopholes, a preference for length and sparse rewards can all change what is learned."}}],"take":{"zh":"DeepSeekMath 与 R1 提供重要实例，但不能把某一奖励提升解释为通用推理能力的定理。","en":"DeepSeekMath and R1 provide important examples, but an improvement in one reward cannot be read as a theorem about general reasoning ability."},"src":{"zh":"[23,24,25]","en":"[23,24,25]"}},
    {"id":"33","part":"rl","kind":"analytic","math":["t33a","t33b"],"title":{"zh":"KL 正则控制与 DPO","en":"KL-regularised control and DPO"},"lead":{"zh":"把奖励最大化与“别偏离参考策略太多”结合，会得到指数倾斜的最优分布。DPO 把这个关系代入偏好模型，直接训练成对回答的相对概率。","en":"Combining reward maximisation with “do not stray too far from a reference policy” gives an exponentially tilted optimal distribution. DPO substitutes this relation into a preference model and trains the relative probability of paired answers directly."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"变分推导","en":"The variational derivation"},"p":{"zh":"对每个 x，加入归一化乘子；对 π(y|x) 求导并设零，解出 log π=log πref+r/β+常数。参考策略必须在候选回答上有正支撑。","en":"For each x add a normalisation multiplier; differentiate with respect to π(y|x), set to zero, and solve: log π=log πref+r/β+constant. The reference policy must have positive support on the candidate answers."}},{"h":{"zh":"偏好如何消去配分函数","en":"How preferences cancel the partition function"},"p":{"zh":"Bradley-Terry 模型令 P(yw≻yl)=σ(rw−rl)。用 r=βlog(π*/πref)+βlog Z 代入，两回答共享的 log Z 抵消，得到 DPO 损失。","en":"The Bradley–Terry model sets P(yw≻yl)=σ(rw−rl). Substituting r=βlog(π*/πref)+βlog Z, the log Z shared by the two answers cancels and the DPO loss results."}},{"h":{"zh":"不要过度推广","en":"Do not over-generalise"},"p":{"zh":"等价关系依赖 KL 正则目标、偏好模型和理想最优策略。有限偏好数据、策略参数化与分布漂移下，DPO 不自动等于任意在线 RL；偏好也不是客观真理标签。","en":"The equivalence depends on the KL-regularised objective, the preference model and an ideal optimal policy. With finite preference data, a parametrised policy and distribution drift, DPO does not automatically equal an arbitrary online RL method; and preferences are not labels of objective truth."}}],"take":{"zh":"DPO 的核心是从正则化最优策略反推出奖励差，而不是“省略所有假设”。","en":"The core of DPO is to recover reward differences from the regularised optimal policy, not to “drop all the assumptions”."},"src":{"zh":"[26]；完整代数见附录 I。","en":"[26]; the full algebra is in Appendix I."}},
    {"id":"34","part":"rl","kind":"analytic","math":["t34a","t34b"],"title":{"zh":"测试时计算：搜索与验证","en":"Test-time compute: search and verification"},"lead":{"zh":"推理时多花计算，可能用于增加候选、加深搜索、修订答案或调用验证器。收益取决于错误是否互补，以及系统能否识别正确候选。","en":"Extra computation at inference can go into more candidates, deeper search, revising an answer or calling a verifier. The gain depends on whether the errors are complementary, and on whether the system can recognise the correct candidate."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"pass@k 不等于可交付正确率","en":"pass@k is not deliverable accuracy"},"p":{"zh":"若每次独立成功率 p=0.2，k=8 时至少一次成功约 0.832。这个数字假设理想识别成功候选；实际 best-of-k 还依赖验证器，多数投票也有不同统计行为。","en":"If each attempt succeeds independently with p=0.2, then with k=8 the chance of at least one success is about 0.832. That number assumes the successful candidate is recognised perfectly; a real best-of-k also depends on the verifier, and majority voting behaves differently again."}},{"h":{"zh":"为什么会饱和","en":"Why it saturates"},"p":{"zh":"共享提示、知识缺陷和搜索偏置让候选相关。图以“共同失败模式＋条件独立成功”的教学混合模型展示饱和；它不是任何已部署模型的实测曲线。","en":"Shared prompts, gaps in knowledge and search bias make candidates correlated. The demo shows saturation with a teaching mixture model, “a common failure mode plus conditionally independent successes”; it is not a measured curve of any deployed model."}},{"h":{"zh":"研究问题","en":"Research questions"},"p":{"zh":"预算应分配给边际收益最高的题目或分支，且需要估计不确定性。形式验证能在明确公理、形式化陈述与可信检查器下验证证明；自然语言答案不能无条件继承这一保证。","en":"The budget should go to the problems or branches with the highest marginal gain, which requires estimating uncertainty. Formal verification can check a proof given explicit axioms, a formalised statement and a trusted checker; an answer in natural language does not inherit that guarantee unconditionally."}}],"take":{"zh":"增加候选能提高覆盖；选择可靠答案还需要独立的验证能力。","en":"More candidates raise coverage; choosing a reliable answer still needs an independent ability to verify."},"src":{"zh":"[27]","en":"[27]"}},
    {"id":"35","part":"theory","kind":"analytic","math":["t35a","t35b"],"title":{"zh":"Scaling laws：受约束的资源分配","en":"Scaling laws: allocating resources under a constraint"},"lead":{"zh":"缩放律是给定训练体系下的经验模型。它用于分配模型规模、数据和计算预算，不是保证无限增长必然带来某种能力的自然定律。","en":"A scaling law is an empirical model within a given training regime. It is used to allocate model size, data and compute; it is not a law of nature guaranteeing that unlimited growth must bring some capability."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"推导最优比例","en":"Deriving the optimal proportions"},"p":{"zh":"将 D=C/(kN) 代入损失，对 N 求导：αaN⁻ᵅ=βbkᵝNᵝC⁻ᵝ。解得 N 的幂次，再由预算求 D。α≈β 时，两者随 C 近似平方根增长。","en":"Substitute D=C/(kN) into the loss and differentiate with respect to N: αaN⁻ᵅ=βbkᵝNᵝC⁻ᵝ. Solve for the power of N, then get D from the budget. When α≈β both grow roughly as the square root of C."}},{"h":{"zh":"经验系数有适用域","en":"Empirical coefficients have a domain of validity"},"p":{"zh":"N 通常指稠密参数或某种有效规模，D 指训练 token 数；重复数据、质量差异、稀疏专家、上下文长度和优化器都会改变常数及拟合指数。图使用明确设定的教学系数。","en":"N usually means dense parameters or some effective size, and D the number of training tokens; repeated data, differences in quality, sparse experts, context length and the optimiser all change the constants and the fitted exponents. The demo uses explicitly stated teaching coefficients."}},{"h":{"zh":"训练之外还有推理成本","en":"Beyond training there is inference cost"},"p":{"zh":"部署频率高时，训练最优未必全生命周期最优。小模型训练更久可能降低长期推理成本；测试时计算也应进入联合预算，而不是孤立看预训练 FLOPs。","en":"When deployment is frequent, the training optimum need not be the optimum over the whole life cycle. Training a small model for longer may lower long-run inference cost; test-time compute should enter a joint budget too, instead of looking at pre-training FLOPs alone."}}],"take":{"zh":"能外推到哪里，需要由拟合范围、误差条与额外实验说明。","en":"How far one may extrapolate has to be shown by the fitted range, the error bars and additional experiments."},"src":{"zh":"[32]；推导详见附录 J。","en":"[32]; the derivation is in Appendix J."}},
    {"id":"36","part":"theory","kind":"numeric","math":["t36a","t36b"],"title":{"zh":"泛化、双下降与 NTK","en":"Generalisation, double descent and the NTK"},"lead":{"zh":"过参数化模型可以拟合训练集却仍然泛化。理解这一现象需要同时讨论数据结构、算法隐式偏置、参数化和噪声，而不只数参数。","en":"An over-parametrised model can fit the training set and still generalise. Understanding this requires discussing data structure, the implicit bias of the algorithm, the parametrisation and the noise together, not just counting parameters."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"双下降的机制图","en":"The mechanism of double descent"},"p":{"zh":"接近插值阈值时，对噪声的拟合可能不稳定；继续增大模型后，某些最小范数解的测试误差又下降。这不意味着每种网络、数据、训练策略都出现同形曲线。","en":"Near the interpolation threshold the fit to noise can be unstable; as the model grows further, the test error of certain minimum-norm solutions falls again. This does not mean every network, data set and training strategy shows a curve of the same shape."}},{"h":{"zh":"NTK 的可分析极限","en":"The analysable limit of the NTK"},"p":{"zh":"在特定无限宽、初始化和学习率缩放下，训练期间核近似不变，函数演化类似核回归。有限宽模型会学习新特征；用固定核解释全部大模型能力超出了该极限。","en":"Under a specific infinite-width limit with a particular scaling of initialisation and learning rate, the kernel stays approximately constant during training and the function evolves like kernel regression. Finite-width models learn new features; explaining all the abilities of large models with a fixed kernel goes beyond that limit."}},{"h":{"zh":"研究前沿","en":"The research frontier"},"p":{"zh":"隐式正则、特征学习、数据重复和分布外迁移尚无统一完备理论。PAC-Bayes、稳定性与压缩界提供不同视角，但数值可能宽松，应区分非空泛保证与概念性解释。","en":"Implicit regularisation, feature learning, data repetition and out-of-distribution transfer have no unified, complete theory yet. PAC-Bayes, stability and compression bounds offer different views, but the numbers can be loose; non-vacuous guarantees should be told apart from conceptual explanations."}}],"take":{"zh":"训练损失趋零只是插值事实，泛化必须在明确数据分布与评价协议下讨论。","en":"A training loss going to zero is only the fact of interpolation; generalisation must be discussed under an explicit data distribution and evaluation protocol."},"src":{"zh":"[33,34]","en":"[33,34]"}},
    {"id":"37","part":"theory","kind":"numeric","math":["t37a","t37b"],"title":{"zh":"校准与保形预测","en":"Calibration and conformal prediction"},"lead":{"zh":"模型概率能否当成可信度，需要校准检验。保形预测进一步用校准集构造预测集合，在交换性条件下给出有限样本的边缘覆盖保证。","en":"Whether a model’s probabilities can be taken as confidence needs a calibration check. Conformal prediction goes further: it builds prediction sets from a calibration set and, under exchangeability, gives a finite-sample guarantee of marginal coverage."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"一个可用构造","en":"A usable construction"},"p":{"zh":"先固定训练好的模型，在独立校准集计算 n 个非一致性分数。用修正后的次序统计量选阈值，新样本标签分数不超过阈值时纳入集合。若所需秩为 n+1，约定阈值为 +∞。","en":"Fix the trained model first, and compute n non-conformity scores on an independent calibration set. Pick the threshold by a corrected order statistic; a label enters the set for a new sample when its score does not exceed the threshold. If the required rank is n+1, the threshold is taken to be +∞."}},{"h":{"zh":"保证是什么","en":"What the guarantee is"},"p":{"zh":"交换性使新分数在 n+1 个分数中的秩近似均匀；于是获得边缘覆盖。它不是对每个给定 x 都达到 1−α 的条件覆盖，也不承诺预测集合一定很小。","en":"Exchangeability makes the rank of the new score among the n+1 scores approximately uniform; marginal coverage follows. It is not conditional coverage of 1−α for every given x, and it does not promise that the prediction set is small."}},{"h":{"zh":"大模型中的难点","en":"The difficulty with large models"},"p":{"zh":"开放文本的候选空间巨大，正确性定义、评分规则和检索截断都影响集合构造。分布漂移、适应性多轮使用或复用校准数据会破坏简单保证。","en":"The candidate space of open text is huge, and the definition of correctness, the scoring rule and retrieval truncation all affect how the set is built. Distribution drift, adaptive multi-round use or reusing calibration data break the simple guarantee."}}],"take":{"zh":"置信度、校准、覆盖率与事实正确性，必须分别定义。","en":"Confidence, calibration, coverage and factual correctness must each be defined separately."},"src":{"zh":"[35]","en":"[35]"}},
    {"id":"38","part":"theory","kind":"construct","math":["t38a","t38b"],"title":{"zh":"因果：从观察到干预","en":"Causality: from observation to intervention"},"lead":{"zh":"预测回答“看到 X 后 Y 通常怎样”；因果回答“主动改变 X 后 Y 会怎样”。两者差异来自生成机制，以及被观察相关性遮住的混杂因素。","en":"Prediction answers “what is Y usually like after seeing X”; causality answers “what happens to Y after actively changing X”. The difference comes from the generating mechanism, and from confounders hidden behind the observed correlation."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"结构方程视角","en":"The structural-equation view"},"p":{"zh":"设 Z 影响 X 和 Y，而 X 也影响 Y。干预 do(X=x) 用常数替代 X 的结构方程，切断指向 X 的箭头；观察条件 X=x 则保留原有选择机制。","en":"Let Z influence X and Y, while X also influences Y. The intervention do(X=x) replaces the structural equation of X by a constant and cuts the arrows pointing into X; conditioning on the observation X=x keeps the original selection mechanism."}},{"h":{"zh":"调整不是盲目加变量","en":"Adjustment is not adding variables blindly"},"p":{"zh":"后门调整要求 Z 阻断全部后门路径，且不包含 X 的后代，并需一致性、正值性等识别条件。控制碰撞点可能打开虚假关联，控制中介会改变目标效应。","en":"Back-door adjustment requires Z to block all back-door paths and to contain no descendant of X, and it needs identification conditions such as consistency and positivity. Controlling for a collider can open a spurious association; controlling for a mediator changes the target effect."}},{"h":{"zh":"与前沿 AI 的关系","en":"The link to frontier AI"},"p":{"zh":"世界模型、策略评估和科学发现都需要区分相关与干预。语言模型从文本预测得到的世界知识，不自动提供可识别的因果效应；要结合实验、结构假设或多环境信息。","en":"World models, policy evaluation and scientific discovery all need to tell correlation from intervention. The knowledge of the world a language model gains by predicting text does not automatically provide identifiable causal effects; experiments, structural assumptions or multi-environment information have to be brought in."}}],"take":{"zh":"因果结论来自数据与可辩护的结构假设共同作用。","en":"Causal conclusions come from data and defensible structural assumptions acting together."},"src":{"zh":"[36]","en":"[36]"}},
    {"id":"39","part":"theory","kind":"analytic","math":["t39a","t39b"],"title":{"zh":"群、等变性与分子模型","en":"Groups, equivariance and molecular models"},"lead":{"zh":"旋转一个分子不会改变标量能量，却会旋转力向量。把这种对称性写进网络，可以减少无意义的自由度，并改善物理一致性。","en":"Rotating a molecule does not change its scalar energy, but it does rotate the force vectors. Writing this symmetry into the network removes meaningless degrees of freedom and improves physical consistency."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"不变与等变","en":"Invariance and equivariance"},"p":{"zh":"标量输出不变，对向量输出则要求变换一致。公式采用每列一个原子坐标的 X∈R³ˣᴺ；R 左乘坐标，t 为平移列向量。图中点集整体旋转后，距离保持，箭头同步旋转。","en":"A scalar output is invariant; a vector output must transform consistently. The formula uses X∈R³ˣᴺ with one atom per column; R multiplies the coordinates from the left and t is a translation column vector. When the point set in the demo rotates as a whole, distances are kept and the arrows rotate with it."}},{"h":{"zh":"如何构造","en":"How to build it"},"p":{"zh":"图网络可用原子类型、距离等不变量生成标量权重，再乘相对位置向量形成等变消息。更强方法使用球谐函数与不可约表示，通过张量积组合不同角动量通道。","en":"A graph network can produce scalar weights from invariants such as atom types and distances, and multiply them by relative position vectors to form equivariant messages. Stronger methods use spherical harmonics and irreducible representations, combining channels of different angular momentum by tensor products."}},{"h":{"zh":"科研边界","en":"Limits in research"},"p":{"zh":"SE(3) 只含旋转和平移；E(3) 还含反射。手性任务是否需要反射敏感必须明确。对称性正确不保证能量面精确，仍需检查训练覆盖、长程相互作用和守恒误差。","en":"SE(3) contains only rotations and translations; E(3) also contains reflections. Whether a chirality task needs sensitivity to reflection must be made explicit. A correct symmetry does not guarantee an accurate energy surface; training coverage, long-range interactions and conservation errors still need checking."}}],"take":{"zh":"归纳偏置把已知物理结构固化进函数类，但不能替代数据与验证。","en":"An inductive bias fixes known physical structure into the function class, but it cannot replace data and validation."},"src":{"zh":"[37]","en":"[37]"}},
    {"id":"40","part":"theory","kind":"analytic","math":["t40a","t40b"],"title":{"zh":"神经算子、Fourier 与 PDE","en":"Neural operators, Fourier and PDEs"},"lead":{"zh":"普通网络学习有限维向量到向量；神经算子试图学习函数到函数的映射，例如从材料系数场映射到 PDE 解场。","en":"An ordinary network learns a map from finite-dimensional vectors to vectors; a neural operator tries to learn a map from functions to functions, for example from a field of material coefficients to the solution field of a PDE."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"Fourier 层","en":"The Fourier layer"},"p":{"zh":"FFT 将函数离散值转换到频域，对保留的模式进行可学习线性变换，再逆变换并加局部通道映射。低频截断提供压缩，但不能无条件恢复高频细节或跨越任意网格。","en":"An FFT takes the discrete values of a function to the frequency domain, a learnable linear transform acts on the modes that are kept, and an inverse transform plus a local channel map follows. Low-frequency truncation compresses, but it cannot recover high-frequency detail unconditionally or cross arbitrary grids."}},{"h":{"zh":"与 PINN 区别","en":"The difference from PINNs"},"p":{"zh":"PINN 常用自动微分计算方程残差，把 PDE 和边界条件作为损失；神经算子强调跨多个输入函数学习解映射。两种思想可以组合，却不等同。","en":"A PINN usually computes the residual of the equation by automatic differentiation and uses the PDE and boundary conditions as losses; a neural operator emphasises learning the solution map across many input functions. The two ideas can be combined, but they are not the same."}},{"h":{"zh":"必须检查","en":"What must be checked"},"p":{"zh":"边界、初值、单位、守恒量和参考求解器误差都要纳入评估。残差在有限采样点很小，不自动推出全域解误差很小；还需要稳定性估计、适当范数与采样覆盖。","en":"Boundaries, initial values, units, conserved quantities and the error of the reference solver all belong in the evaluation. A small residual at finitely many sample points does not by itself imply a small solution error over the whole domain; stability estimates, a suitable norm and sampling coverage are needed as well."}}],"take":{"zh":"学习一个解函数、学习一个解算子、学习一个数值求解器，是相关但不同的任务。","en":"Learning one solution function, learning a solution operator, and learning a numerical solver are related but different tasks."},"src":{"zh":"[38,39]","en":"[38,39]"}},
    {"id":"41","part":"theory","kind":"analytic","math":["t41a","t41b","t41c"],"title":{"zh":"能量、Langevin 与自由能","en":"Energy, Langevin and free energy"},"lead":{"zh":"能量模型把偏好编码为低能量区域，再通过配分函数变成概率。它把统计物理、采样、概率学习和科学 AI 连接起来。","en":"An energy model encodes preference as regions of low energy, and turns it into probability through the partition function. It connects statistical physics, sampling, probabilistic learning and scientific AI."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"平衡分布","en":"The equilibrium distribution"},"p":{"zh":"在可归一化、适当边界与遍历性条件下，Langevin 动力学以 Gibbs 分布为不变分布。有限步长的离散 Langevin 一般带偏差；高能垒会造成混合缓慢。","en":"Under normalisability, suitable boundaries and ergodicity, Langevin dynamics has the Gibbs distribution as its invariant distribution. Discrete Langevin with a finite step is biased in general; high energy barriers make mixing slow."}},{"h":{"zh":"自由能的变分意义","en":"The variational meaning of free energy"},"p":{"zh":"把 log p=−E/T−log Z 代入 KL，整理即得第三式。最小自由能分布是 p；这里 T>0，H 是相对固定参考测度的微分熵，不能忽略测度与单位约定。","en":"Substitute log p=−E/T−log Z into the KL and rearrange: the third formula results. The distribution of minimum free energy is p; here T>0 and H is the differential entropy relative to a fixed reference measure, so the conventions for measure and units cannot be ignored."}},{"h":{"zh":"与扩散的区别","en":"The difference from diffusion"},"p":{"zh":"固定能量 Langevin 追求一个平衡分布；扩散／score 生成使用随时间变化的密度族。二者共享 score 与随机动力学，但训练和采样目标并不相同。","en":"Langevin with a fixed energy aims at one equilibrium distribution; diffusion / score-based generation uses a family of densities that changes with time. They share the score and stochastic dynamics, but their training and sampling goals are not the same."}}],"take":{"zh":"能量低不等于概率质量必然大：体积与熵也共同决定质量。","en":"Low energy does not mean the probability mass must be large: volume and entropy decide the mass as well."},"src":{"zh":"原创恒等式与例子；背景 [1,18]。","en":"Original identity and example; background [1,18]."}},
    {"id":"42","part":"front","kind":"analytic","math":["t42a","t42b"],"title":{"zh":"2026 前沿：误差不止一种","en":"The 2026 frontier: more than one kind of error"},"lead":{"zh":"讲义核对到 2026-11-12 可检索的一手资料。最新不等于最可靠；这个主题以近期论文说明数学研究正在补哪些缺口，不作模型排行榜或完备文献综述。","en":"The notes were checked against primary sources retrievable up to 2026-11-12. Newest does not mean most reliable; this topic uses recent papers to show which gaps mathematical research is filling, and offers neither a model leaderboard nor a complete literature review."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"新的理论问题","en":"New theoretical questions"},"p":{"zh":"2026-11-01 的流匹配预印本 [40] 明确把有限数据统计误差、有限步优化误差、函数逼近与尾部误差纳入分析，并依赖路径正则性与流稳定性等假设。这里不把其结论宣称为无条件大模型保证。","en":"The flow-matching preprint [40] of 2026-11-01 explicitly brings the statistical error of finite data, the optimisation error of finitely many steps, function approximation and tail error into the analysis, and relies on assumptions such as path regularity and flow stability. Its conclusions are not presented here as an unconditional guarantee for large models."}},{"h":{"zh":"图与公式的身份","en":"The status of the figure and the formula"},"p":{"zh":"示意图是原创的误差分类图，不是该论文的定理或实验。第二式来自 Lipschitz 场的简单 Grönwall 稳定性估计：若沿比较轨迹的速度误差≤δ(t)，则轨迹差被指数稳定因子放大。","en":"The diagram is an original classification of errors, not a theorem or experiment of that paper. The second formula comes from a simple Grönwall stability estimate for a Lipschitz field: if the velocity error along the compared trajectory is ≤δ(t), the trajectory gap is amplified by an exponential stability factor."}},{"h":{"zh":"方法侧仍在推进","en":"Methods keep advancing too"},"p":{"zh":"Muon 研究矩阵更新几何；mHC 约束信号混合；MeanFlow 学区间平均速度；离散扩散语言研究并行生成。它们解决不同瓶颈，没有证据说明某一个方向已统一取代其他方向。","en":"Muon studies the geometry of matrix updates; mHC constrains the mixing of signals; MeanFlow learns the average velocity over an interval; discrete-diffusion language modelling studies parallel generation. They address different bottlenecks, and there is no evidence that any one direction has replaced the others."}}],"take":{"zh":"读前沿论文先找：被控制的误差、使用的范数、假设、常数与实验适用域。","en":"Reading a frontier paper, first find: which error is controlled, which norm is used, the assumptions, the constants and the domain where the experiments apply."},"src":{"zh":"[6,10,19,20,40]；[40] 为近期预印本。","en":"[6,10,19,20,40]; [40] is a recent preprint."}},
    {"id":"43","part":"front","kind":"construct","math":["t43a","t43b"],"title":{"zh":"五条贯穿全书的数学主线","en":"Five mathematical threads running through the notes"},"lead":{"zh":"最有用的研究能力不是记住更多缩写，而是把新方法翻译回少数可检验的数学对象。下面的对应关系是理解工具，不是宣布算法彼此等价。","en":"The most useful research skill is not remembering more acronyms but translating a new method back into a few testable mathematical objects. The correspondences below are tools for understanding, not a declaration that the algorithms are equivalent."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"投影与几何","en":"Projection and geometry"},"p":{"zh":"最小二乘、去噪和 FM 共享条件期望投影；SVD、LoRA、Muon 研究不同的矩阵结构；Fisher 与 KL 说明“距离”依赖对象是参数、函数还是分布。","en":"Least squares, denoising and FM share the conditional-expectation projection; SVD, LoRA and Muon study different matrix structures; Fisher and KL show that “distance” depends on whether the object is a parameter, a function or a distribution."}},{"h":{"zh":"运输与动力学","en":"Transport and dynamics"},"p":{"zh":"残差层可被看作离散动力学，CNF 和扩散显式建模时间演化，OT 选择端点耦合。但普通残差网络不因此自动满足连续 ODE 的可逆性或稳定性条件。","en":"A residual layer can be seen as discrete dynamics, CNFs and diffusion model the evolution in time explicitly, and OT chooses the coupling of the endpoints. But an ordinary residual network does not thereby satisfy the invertibility or stability conditions of a continuous ODE."}},{"h":{"zh":"信息、控制与对称性","en":"Information, control and symmetry"},"p":{"zh":"交叉熵压缩预测误差；KL 正则把奖励选择变成指数倾斜；等变性限制函数类；验证器约束可接受解。研究时应分别问“表达什么、优化什么、保证什么、代价多少”。","en":"Cross-entropy compresses prediction error; KL regularisation turns the choice of reward into exponential tilting; equivariance restricts the function class; a verifier constrains the acceptable solutions. In research ask separately “what is expressed, what is optimised, what is guaranteed, at what cost”."}}],"take":{"zh":"统一视角的价值是暴露共同假设与差异，而不是抹平算法之间的边界。","en":"The value of a unified view is to expose shared assumptions and differences, not to erase the boundaries between algorithms."},"src":{"zh":"这个主题为作者综合；各对应方向来源见前文。","en":"A synthesis by the notes’ author; sources for each direction are in the earlier topics."}},
    {"id":"44","part":"front","kind":"construct","math":["t44a","t44b"],"title":{"zh":"一次研究级阅读怎么做","en":"How to do one research-level reading"},"lead":{"zh":"把每篇新论文压缩成六个对象：空间、分布、算子、目标、算法、保证。随后寻找能手算、能模拟、能反驳的最小例子。","en":"Compress every new paper into six objects: space, distribution, operator, objective, algorithm, guarantee. Then look for the smallest example that can be computed by hand, simulated, and refuted."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"第一轮：定义是否闭合","en":"Round one: are the definitions closed?"},"p":{"zh":"写出全部张量维数、时间方向、条件变量、采样分布、归一化与边界。若同一个符号同时表示方差和标准差，先统一；若损失期望来自旧策略，不能默认为新策略。","en":"Write out every tensor dimension, the direction of time, the conditioning variables, the sampling distribution, the normalisation and the boundaries. If one symbol stands for both variance and standard deviation, unify it first; if the expectation in a loss comes from the old policy, it cannot be assumed to be under the new one."}},{"h":{"zh":"第二轮：推导是否成立","en":"Round two: does the derivation hold?"},"p":{"zh":"逐项检查积分求导交换、支撑、可逆性、Lipschitz、正值性与独立性。看清“充要”“充分”“上界”“渐近”“高概率”“期望保证”的差别。","en":"Check item by item the exchange of integral and derivative, support, invertibility, Lipschitz conditions, positivity and independence. Be clear about the differences among “necessary and sufficient”, “sufficient”, “upper bound”, “asymptotic”, “with high probability” and “guarantee in expectation”."}},{"h":{"zh":"第三轮：实验能否支持结论","en":"Round three: can the experiments support the conclusion?"},"p":{"zh":"对齐数据、参数量、激活参数、NFE、训练 FLOPs 与推理延迟；报告多随机种子和误差条。先复现高斯、二次损失、二动作 bandit 等可解例子，再解释规模化结果。","en":"Align data, parameter counts, active parameters, NFE, training FLOPs and inference latency; report several random seeds and error bars. Reproduce solvable examples first, such as the Gaussian, the quadratic loss and the two-action bandit, and only then interpret results at scale."}}],"take":{"zh":"开放问题可以来自一个不成立的交换步骤、一项失控误差或一个被忽略的预算。","en":"An open problem can come from one exchange step that fails, one error left uncontrolled, or one budget that was ignored."},"src":{"zh":"原创研究检查框架。","en":"Original research checklist."}}
  );
  D.appendices.push(
    {"id":"A","part":"appendix","kind":"analytic","math":["aA1","aA2","aA3"],"demo":"08","title":{"zh":"KL 的二阶展开与自然梯度","en":"The second-order expansion of KL and the natural gradient"},"lead":{"zh":"目标：说明为何 Fisher 是分布空间的局部度量，并给出带约束步长的显式解。假设 pθ 正则、支撑固定、二阶导数可交换积分。","en":"Goal: to show why Fisher is the local metric of the space of distributions, and to give the explicit solution for a constrained step. Assume pθ is regular, has fixed support, and second derivatives can be exchanged with the integral."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"步骤 1：展开 KL","en":"Step 1: expand the KL"},"p":{"zh":"KL(pθ||pθ+Δ)=Eθ[log pθ−log pθ+Δ]。将第二项 Taylor 展开，线性项为 −Eθ[s]ᵀΔ=0，二次项为−ΔᵀEθ[∇²log pθ]Δ/2。","en":"KL(pθ||pθ+Δ)=Eθ[log pθ−log pθ+Δ]. Taylor-expand the second term: the linear term is −Eθ[s]ᵀΔ=0 and the quadratic term is −ΔᵀEθ[∇²log pθ]Δ/2."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 2：求 Hessian 期望","en":"Step 2: the expected Hessian"},"p":{"zh":"∇²log p=(∇²p)/p−(∇p)(∇p)ᵀ/p²。乘 p 后积分，第一项等于 ∇²∫p=0，余项给出 −F。","en":"∇²log p=(∇²p)/p−(∇p)(∇p)ᵀ/p². Multiply by p and integrate: the first term equals ∇²∫p=0 and the rest gives −F."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 3：约束极小化","en":"Step 3: constrained minimisation"},"p":{"zh":"对 gᵀΔ+λ(ΔᵀFΔ/2−δ) 求导得 g+λFΔ=0。若 F 正定、g≠0，代入活动约束求 λ 即得上式。若 g=0，可取 Δ=0；F 奇异时需讨论可行子空间或阻尼。","en":"Differentiating gᵀΔ+λ(ΔᵀFΔ/2−δ) gives g+λFΔ=0. If F is positive definite and g≠0, substituting into the active constraint to find λ yields the formula above. If g=0 one may take Δ=0; when F is singular the feasible subspace or damping has to be discussed."}}],"take":{"zh":"自然梯度的方向与步长都来自局部 KL 椭球。","en":"Both the direction and the length of the natural-gradient step come from the local KL ellipsoid."},"src":{"zh":"[5]","en":"[5]"}},
    {"id":"B","part":"appendix","kind":"analytic","math":["aB1","aB2","aB3"],"demo":"11","title":{"zh":"注意力的完整矩阵反向式","en":"The full matrix backward pass of attention"},"lead":{"zh":"设 O=AV，A=row-softmax(S)，S=QKᵀ/√d，并已知上游 G=∂L/∂O。以下推导不含 dropout；掩码位置的梯度按被屏蔽处理。","en":"Let O=AV, A=row-softmax(S), S=QKᵀ/√d, with the upstream G=∂L/∂O known. The derivation has no dropout; gradients at masked positions are treated as blocked."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"步骤 1：矩阵乘法","en":"Step 1: the matrix product"},"p":{"zh":"dO=dA·V+A·dV。把 dL=tr(GᵀdO) 用迹的循环性质整理成各个微分的内积，得到 V 与 A 的伴随。","en":"dO=dA·V+A·dV. Rearranging dL=tr(GᵀdO) with the cyclic property of the trace into inner products with each differential gives the adjoints of V and A."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 2：每行 softmax","en":"Step 2: the softmax of each row"},"p":{"zh":"对 a=softmax(s)，da=(diag(a)−aaᵀ)ds。该 Jacobian 对称，乘该行上游梯度 b，得到 a⊙(b−⟨a,b⟩1)。逐行就是第二式。","en":"For a=softmax(s), da=(diag(a)−aaᵀ)ds. This Jacobian is symmetric; multiplying by the row’s upstream gradient b gives a⊙(b−⟨a,b⟩1). Row by row this is the second formula."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 3：回到输入","en":"Step 3: back to the inputs"},"p":{"zh":"由 dS=(dQ·Kᵀ+Q·dKᵀ)/√d 得最后两式。若 Q=XWQ，另有 ∂L/∂WQ=XᵀQ̄、输入贡献 Q̄WQᵀ；K、V 分支同理相加。可用方向有限差分核验此计算图。","en":"From dS=(dQ·Kᵀ+Q·dKᵀ)/√d come the last two formulas. If Q=XWQ, then also ∂L/∂WQ=XᵀQ̄ and the input receives Q̄WQᵀ; the K and V branches add in the same way. The computation graph can be checked by a directional finite difference, which the button in the demo does."}}],"take":{"zh":"维数自检：Q̄ 与 Q 同形，K̄ 与 K 同形，V̄ 与 V 同形。","en":"A check on dimensions: Q̄ has the shape of Q, K̄ the shape of K, V̄ the shape of V."},"src":{"zh":"原创矩阵推导，机制来源 [7]。","en":"Original matrix derivation; the mechanism is from [7]."}},
    {"id":"C","part":"appendix","kind":"analytic","math":["aC1","aC2"],"demo":"18","title":{"zh":"ELBO 与高斯 KL 的闭式","en":"The ELBO and the closed form of the Gaussian KL"},"lead":{"zh":"设 q(z|x)=N(μ,diag(σ²))，先验 p(z)=N(0,I)。下面把 VAE 目标分解成可训练的两项，并把其 KL 写成无需采样的闭式。","en":"Let q(z|x)=N(μ,diag(σ²)) and the prior p(z)=N(0,I). The VAE objective is split into two trainable terms, and its KL is written in a closed form that needs no sampling."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"步骤 1：同一个量两种展开","en":"Step 1: one quantity, two expansions"},"p":{"zh":"左侧使用 pθ(x,z)=pθ(x|z)p(z)，得到重建期望减先验 KL；右侧使用 pθ(x,z)=pθ(z|x)pθ(x)，得到证据减后验 KL。两式相等即 ELBO 分解。","en":"On the left use pθ(x,z)=pθ(x|z)p(z) to get the expected reconstruction minus the KL to the prior; on the right use pθ(x,z)=pθ(z|x)pθ(x) to get the evidence minus the KL to the posterior. Their equality is the ELBO decomposition."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 2：积分高斯对数比","en":"Step 2: integrate the Gaussian log-ratio"},"p":{"zh":"log q−log p 含 −Σlogσⱼ 与二次项。E[(zⱼ−μⱼ)²/σⱼ²]=1，而 E[zⱼ²]=μⱼ²+σⱼ²，逐维相减得到第二式。要求所有 σⱼ>0。","en":"log q−log p contains −Σlogσⱼ and quadratic terms. E[(zⱼ−μⱼ)²/σⱼ²]=1 while E[zⱼ²]=μⱼ²+σⱼ²; subtracting dimension by dimension gives the second formula. All σⱼ>0 is required."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 3：可训练参数","en":"Step 3: trainable parameters"},"p":{"zh":"常输出 ℓⱼ=logσⱼ²，令 σⱼ=exp(ℓⱼ/2)，避免负标准差。对 ε 抽样重建项，对高斯 KL 用解析式。微分与期望交换仍需可积性，不能仅因使用重参数化就忽略。","en":"Commonly the output is ℓⱼ=logσⱼ² with σⱼ=exp(ℓⱼ/2), which avoids a negative standard deviation. The reconstruction term is sampled through ε and the Gaussian KL uses the analytic formula. Exchanging differentiation and expectation still needs integrability; reparametrisation alone does not excuse it."}}],"take":{"zh":"ELBO 的松紧由后验近似 KL 决定；高斯 KL 闭式降低了目标估计方差。","en":"How tight the ELBO is depends on the KL of the posterior approximation; the closed-form Gaussian KL lowers the variance of the objective’s estimate."},"src":{"zh":"[15]","en":"[15]"}},
    {"id":"D","part":"appendix","kind":"analytic","math":["aD1","aD2","aD3"],"demo":"21","title":{"zh":"去噪、Tweedie 与 score","en":"Denoising, Tweedie and the score"},"lead":{"zh":"取 X=aX₀+σε，σ>0，ε∼N(0,I) 且独立。这里 a、σ 固定于某一时刻。目标是从去噪回归直接得到边缘密度的 score。","en":"Take X=aX₀+σε with σ>0 and independent ε∼N(0,I). Here a and σ are fixed at one moment. The goal is to get the score of the marginal density directly from denoising regression."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"步骤 1：Bayes 权重","en":"Step 1: Bayes weights"},"p":{"zh":"将第一式除以 p(x)，积分中的 p(x|x₀)p₀(x₀)/p(x) 正好是后验 p(x₀|x)。因此积分等于条件期望，而不是某个单一样本的 x₀。","en":"Divide the first formula by p(x): the factor p(x|x₀)p₀(x₀)/p(x) inside the integral is exactly the posterior p(x₀|x). The integral is therefore a conditional expectation, not the x₀ of some single sample."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 2：平方损失最优解","en":"Step 2: the optimum of squared loss"},"p":{"zh":"写 Y=f*(X)+(Y−f*(X))，展开平方。交叉项的条件期望为零，因为 E[Y−f*(X)|X]=0。向量 Y 时，最后一项应理解为条件协方差迹的期望。","en":"Write Y=f*(X)+(Y−f*(X)) and expand the square. The conditional expectation of the cross term is zero because E[Y−f*(X)|X]=0. For vector Y the last term is to be read as the expected trace of the conditional covariance."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 3：三种预测参数化","en":"Step 3: three prediction parametrisations"},"p":{"zh":"取 Y=ε 得最优噪声预测；取 Y=X₀ 得最优去噪预测；二者通过 X=aX₀+σε 联系。a≠0 时 E[X₀|X=x]=(x+σ²s(x))/a；a=0 时不能做这一除法。","en":"Y=ε gives the optimal noise prediction; Y=X₀ gives the optimal denoiser; the two are linked through X=aX₀+σε. When a≠0, E[X₀|X=x]=(x+σ²s(x))/a; when a=0 that division cannot be done."}}],"take":{"zh":"条件均值投影解释去噪恒等式，但不保证单个恢复样本就是原始真实样本。","en":"Projection onto the conditional mean explains the denoising identity, but it does not guarantee that a single restored sample is the original one."},"src":{"zh":"[18]","en":"[18]"}},
    {"id":"E","part":"appendix","kind":"analytic","math":["aE1","aE2","aE3"],"demo":"22","title":{"zh":"反向时间漂移与概率流","en":"The reverse-time drift and the probability flow"},"lead":{"zh":"为避免负 dt 的歧义，定义反向正时钟 τ=T−t，密度 qτ=pT−τ。扩散 g(t) 为标量、只依赖时间，密度正且足够光滑。","en":"To avoid the ambiguity of a negative dt, define the forward-running reverse clock τ=T−t and the density qτ=pT−τ. The diffusion g(t) is a scalar depending on time only, and the density is positive and smooth enough."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"步骤 1：反转密度方程","en":"Step 1: reverse the density equation"},"p":{"zh":"原方程为 ∂ₜp=−∇·(fp)+g²Δp/2；由 ∂τq=−∂ₜp 得第一式。对反向过程写 −∇·(brev q)+g²Δq/2，代入第二式即可一致。","en":"The original equation is ∂ₜp=−∇·(fp)+g²Δp/2; from ∂τq=−∂ₜp comes the first formula. Writing −∇·(brev q)+g²Δq/2 for the reverse process and substituting the second formula gives agreement."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 2：为什么还需时间反演定理","en":"Step 2: why the time-reversal theorem is still needed"},"p":{"zh":"匹配密度 PDE 只能验证边缘一致，无法单凭它唯一确定所有路径性质。严格确认它是原扩散的时间反演，还需非退化性、正则性等时间反演条件。这里给出代数核验而非省略该定理。","en":"Matching the density PDE verifies only that the marginals agree; on its own it cannot fix all path properties uniquely. To confirm rigorously that this is the time reversal of the original diffusion one also needs the conditions of the time-reversal theorem, such as non-degeneracy and regularity. What is given here is an algebraic check, not a way round that theorem."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 3：确定性概率流","en":"Step 3: the deterministic probability flow"},"p":{"zh":"代入第三式：−∇·(vpf p)=−∇·(fp)+g²Δp/2。它消去随机扩散而保留同一密度变化。若 g=g(x,t)，反向漂移和密度运算需改为扩散矩阵及其散度形式。","en":"Substitute the third formula: −∇·(vpf p)=−∇·(fp)+g²Δp/2. It removes the random diffusion and keeps the same change of density. If g=g(x,t), the reverse drift and the density operator must be rewritten with the diffusion matrix and its divergence."}}],"take":{"zh":"边缘密度一致是可核验结论；路径级等价必须调用更强条件。","en":"Agreement of marginal densities can be verified; path-level equivalence must call on stronger conditions."},"src":{"zh":"[18]","en":"[18]"}},
    {"id":"F","part":"appendix","kind":"analytic","math":["aF1","aF2","aF3"],"demo":"24","title":{"zh":"CFM 与边缘 FM 的等价梯度","en":"CFM and marginal FM have the same gradient"},"lead":{"zh":"令端点耦合与时间采样分布固定，不依赖 θ；Xₜ 是可微随机路径，Uₜ=dXₜ/dt，且二阶矩有限。","en":"Let the coupling of endpoints and the distribution of sampled times be fixed and independent of θ; Xₜ is a differentiable random path, Uₜ=dXₜ/dt, and second moments are finite."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"步骤 1：正交分解","en":"Step 1: orthogonal decomposition"},"p":{"zh":"展开 vθ−U=(vθ−v*)+(v*−U)。对 Xₜ,t 条件化后，交叉项为零。第二项不依赖 θ，故可交换微分时期望损失对 θ 的梯度相同。若耦合也被学习，这个常数论证需重新检查。","en":"Expand vθ−U=(vθ−v*)+(v*−U). After conditioning on Xₜ and t the cross term is zero. The second term does not depend on θ, so where differentiation can be exchanged the expected losses have the same gradient in θ. If the coupling is learned as well, this “constant” argument must be rechecked."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 2：概率质量守恒","en":"Step 2: conservation of probability mass"},"p":{"zh":"对紧支撑光滑测试函数 φ 使用链式法则，再用条件期望塔式法则替换 Uₜ 为 v*。对最后积分分部积分，得到 ∂ₜp+∇·(pv*)=0 的弱形式。","en":"Apply the chain rule to a smooth, compactly supported test function φ, then replace Uₜ by v* using the tower property of conditional expectation. Integrating the last integral by parts gives the weak form of ∂ₜp+∇·(pv*)=0."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 3：从 PDE 到采样","en":"Step 3: from the PDE to sampling"},"p":{"zh":"在 ODE 与连续性方程适定、边界正确且学到精确场时，从 p₀ 积分得到 p₁。有限网络和离散求解不能继承无误差结论；这是需要统计、优化和稳定性理论的地方。","en":"When the ODE and the continuity equation are well posed, the boundary is right and the exact field is learned, integrating from p₀ gives p₁. A finite network and a discrete solver do not inherit the error-free conclusion; this is where statistics, optimisation and stability theory are needed."}}],"take":{"zh":"CFM 简化训练监督，不消除表示误差、有限样本误差或采样误差。","en":"CFM simplifies the training supervision; it does not remove representation error, finite-sample error or sampling error."},"src":{"zh":"[21]","en":"[21]"}},
    {"id":"G","part":"appendix","kind":"analytic","math":["aG1","aG2","aG3"],"demo":"28","title":{"zh":"MeanFlow：全导数不是偏导数","en":"MeanFlow: a total derivative is not a partial derivative"},"lead":{"zh":"固定 r<t，zτ 沿 dzτ/dτ=v(zτ,τ) 运动。平均速度等于位移除以时间跨度，是一段路径的信息，不只取决于当前瞬时切线。","en":"Fix r<t and let zτ move by dzτ/dτ=v(zτ,τ). The average velocity is displacement divided by the time span; it is information about a stretch of path and does not depend only on the current tangent."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"步骤 1：乘积求导","en":"Step 1: differentiate the product"},"p":{"zh":"对第一式沿同一轨迹求 t 全导数。右侧导数为 v(zₜ,t)，左侧为 u+(t−r)du/dt。若漏掉 zₜ 对 t 的依赖，就会错误地只剩 ∂ₜu。","en":"Take the total t-derivative of the first formula along one trajectory. The right-hand side gives v(zₜ,t), the left u+(t−r)du/dt. If the dependence of zₜ on t is forgotten, only ∂ₜu wrongly remains."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 2：JVP 的方向","en":"Step 2: the direction of the JVP"},"p":{"zh":"把 u 的输入写成 (z,r,t)，沿轨迹的方向是 (v,0,1)。因此其 JVP 正好给出全导数，避免显式构造完整 Jacobian。","en":"Write the input of u as (z,r,t); the direction along the trajectory is (v,0,1). Its JVP therefore gives exactly the total derivative, with no need to build the full Jacobian."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 3：训练与边界","en":"Step 3: training and the boundary"},"p":{"zh":"当 t→r，平均速度应趋于瞬时速度。在真速度替换为可训练估计／条件速度目标、并使用 stop-gradient 后，优化过程还需额外分析。恒等式本身不承诺一个神经网络会精确学到它。","en":"As t→r the average velocity should tend to the instantaneous one. Once the true velocity is replaced by a trainable estimate or a conditional-velocity target, and a stop-gradient is used, the optimisation needs further analysis. The identity itself does not promise that a neural network learns it exactly."}}],"take":{"zh":"一步生成的精度取决于学出的区间位移，不由“一步”这个名称保证。","en":"The accuracy of one-step generation depends on the interval displacement that was learned; the name “one step” guarantees nothing."},"src":{"zh":"[19]","en":"[19]"}},
    {"id":"H","part":"appendix","kind":"analytic","math":["aH1","aH2","aH3"],"demo":"31","title":{"zh":"基线无偏性与组均值偏差","en":"Unbiased baselines and the bias of the group mean"},"lead":{"zh":"用单状态 bandit 说明一个容易被忽略的细节：动作无关基线与包含当前样本的组均值，并不是同一个统计对象。","en":"A single-state bandit shows a detail that is easy to miss: an action-independent baseline and a group mean that includes the current sample are not the same statistical object."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"步骤 1：组内独立采样","en":"Step 1: independent sampling within a group"},"p":{"zh":"给定同一问题／状态，从同一策略独立抽取 G 个动作，奖励不显式依赖 θ。组均值为 r̄=G⁻¹Σⱼrⱼ。","en":"Given the same question / state, draw G actions independently from the same policy, with rewards not depending explicitly on θ. The group mean is r̄=G⁻¹Σⱼrⱼ."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 2：计算自包含项","en":"Step 2: the self-inclusion term"},"p":{"zh":"E[gᵢr̄]=G⁻¹E[gᵢrᵢ]+G⁻¹Σⱼ≠ᵢE[gᵢ]E[rⱼ]=∇J/G。减去它便得到 (1−1/G)∇J。该简单情形只改变比例。","en":"E[gᵢr̄]=G⁻¹E[gᵢrᵢ]+G⁻¹Σⱼ≠ᵢE[gᵢ]E[rⱼ]=∇J/G. Subtracting it gives (1−1/G)∇J. In this simple case only the scale changes."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 3：为什么 GRPO 更复杂","en":"Step 3: why GRPO is more complicated"},"p":{"zh":"再除以随机组标准差，或引入裁剪、旧策略概率比、不同长度归一化后，不再能一般性地说只差一个常数。leave-one-out 基线在上述独立条件下恢复无偏，但实际算法优劣还要比较方差与训练稳定性。","en":"After dividing by the random group standard deviation, or adding clipping, old-policy probability ratios and different length normalisations, one can no longer say in general that only a constant differs. A leave-one-out baseline restores unbiasedness under the independence above, but which algorithm is better in practice still depends on variance and training stability."}}],"take":{"zh":"“基线不影响期望”只适用于满足条件的基线，不能对所有中心化操作直接套用。","en":"“A baseline does not change the expectation” applies only to baselines that meet the condition; it cannot be applied directly to every centring operation."},"src":{"zh":"原创 bandit 推导；算法背景 [24]。","en":"Original bandit derivation; algorithmic background [24]."}},
    {"id":"I","part":"appendix","kind":"analytic","math":["aI1","aI2","aI3"],"demo":"33","title":{"zh":"从 KL 控制到偏好逻辑回归","en":"From KL control to preference logistic regression"},"lead":{"zh":"对固定提示 x 省略条件记号，设参考分布 π₀ 在候选集合上为正，β>0，且配分函数有限。","en":"For a fixed prompt x the conditioning is dropped from the notation. Let the reference distribution π₀ be positive on the candidate set, β>0, and the partition function finite."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"步骤 1：归一化与最优性","en":"Step 1: normalisation and optimality"},"p":{"zh":"加 λ(Σπ−1) 并求驻点，得到 π*=π₀exp(r/β)/Z。目标对 π 是凹的，在支撑内部的该解为全局最优；π₀=0 的位置不能任意获得正质量。","en":"Add λ(Σπ−1) and find the stationary point: π*=π₀exp(r/β)/Z. The objective is concave in π, so this solution in the interior of the support is the global optimum; positions where π₀=0 cannot acquire positive mass."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 2：消去不可识别偏移","en":"Step 2: remove the unidentifiable offset"},"p":{"zh":"反解 r(y)=βlog(π*/π₀)+βlog Z。给所有回答加同一常数不改变策略与成对偏好，因此偏好数据只能确定奖励差而非绝对零点。","en":"Solve back for r(y)=βlog(π*/π₀)+βlog Z. Adding the same constant to every answer changes neither the policy nor the pairwise preferences, so preference data can fix reward differences only, not an absolute zero."}},{"h":{"zh":"步骤 3：二元似然","en":"Step 3: the binary likelihood"},"p":{"zh":"Bradley-Terry 假设 P(w≻l)=σ(rw−rl)。用参数策略 πθ 替换理想 π*，对观察到的赢家标签最大化对数似然，得到正文 DPO。该替换是模型拟合步骤，不是对有限训练结果的恒等保证。","en":"Bradley–Terry assumes P(w≻l)=σ(rw−rl). Replace the ideal π* by a parametric policy πθ and maximise the log-likelihood of the observed winners: this is the DPO loss of the main text. That replacement is a model-fitting step, not an identity guaranteeing the result of finite training."}}],"take":{"zh":"奖励差、策略对数比与逻辑回归之间的连接，依赖明确的概率建模假设。","en":"The connection among reward differences, policy log-ratios and logistic regression rests on explicit probabilistic modelling assumptions."},"src":{"zh":"[26]","en":"[26]"}},
    {"id":"J","part":"appendix","kind":"analytic","math":["aJ1","aJ2"],"demo":"35","demo2":"42","title":{"zh":"缩放律的最优解与稳定性界","en":"The optimum of a scaling law and a stability bound"},"lead":{"zh":"两个小推导分别说明如何分配计算，以及如何把速度误差转换为轨迹误差。它们的力量来自清楚的假设，而不是公式长度。","en":"Two small derivations show how to allocate compute and how to turn a velocity error into a trajectory error. Their force comes from clear assumptions, not from the length of the formulas."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"缩放律步骤","en":"The scaling-law step"},"p":{"zh":"对 L∞+aN⁻ᵅ+b(kN/C)ᵝ 求导并乘 N，得 −αaN⁻ᵅ+βb(kN/C)ᵝ=0，整理得第一式。需 a,b,α,β,k>0，并把连续最优值映射回可用架构和预算。","en":"Differentiate L∞+aN⁻ᵅ+b(kN/C)ᵝ and multiply by N: −αaN⁻ᵅ+βb(kN/C)ᵝ=0, which rearranges to the first formula. It needs a,b,α,β,k>0, and the continuous optimum must be mapped back to available architectures and budgets."}},{"h":{"zh":"稳定性步骤","en":"The stability step"},"p":{"zh":"比较 ẋ=v(x,t)、ŷ̇=v̂(ŷ,t)。若 v 对空间 L-Lipschitz，且 ||v(ŷ,t)−v̂(ŷ,t)||≤δ(t)，三角不等式给出 e 的微分上界；乘积分因子 exp(−Lt) 再积分得到第二式。","en":"Compare ẋ=v(x,t) with ŷ̇=v̂(ŷ,t). If v is L-Lipschitz in space and ||v(ŷ,t)−v̂(ŷ,t)||≤δ(t), the triangle inequality gives a differential bound on e; multiplying by the integrating factor exp(−Lt) and integrating gives the second formula."}},{"h":{"zh":"边界提醒","en":"A reminder about limits"},"p":{"zh":"连续参数的极值不涵盖通信和推理成本；轨迹 sup 范数误差界也不等于任意感知指标上界。若只有沿某个分布的 L² 场误差，需要额外的测度和稳定性论证。","en":"The optimum over continuous parameters does not cover communication and inference cost; a bound on trajectory error in the sup norm is not a bound on an arbitrary perceptual metric either. If only an L² error of the field along some distribution is available, extra arguments about measure and stability are needed."}}],"take":{"zh":"一个误差指标转成另一个指标时，最容易隐藏新的假设。","en":"Converting one error measure into another is where new assumptions hide most easily."},"src":{"zh":"[32]；稳定性式为独立教学推导，不是 [40] 定理的转述。","en":"[32]; the stability formula is an independent teaching derivation, not a restatement of a theorem in [40]."}},
    {"id":"K","part":"appendix","kind":"numeric","math":["aK1","aK2"],"demo":"K","title":{"zh":"三个可复现数值检查","en":"Three reproducible numerical checks"},"lead":{"zh":"讲义图形由固定随机种子和明确数学模型生成。以下检查针对推导本身，不是训练大模型，也不应被解释为论文性能复现。","en":"The figures of the notes were generated from fixed random seeds and explicit mathematical models. The checks below concern the derivations themselves; they train no large model and should not be read as reproducing any paper’s performance. On this page the same checks run again in your browser."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"检查 1：注意力梯度","en":"Check 1: the attention gradient"},"p":{"zh":"随机生成小型 Q、K、V 与线性上游损失，用附录 B 的反向式计算梯度，再与中心有限差分方向导数比较。步长太小会发生舍入误差，太大又有截断误差。","en":"Generate small random Q, K, V and a linear upstream loss, compute the gradient with the backward pass of Appendix B, and compare with a central finite-difference directional derivative. Too small a step brings rounding error, too large a step truncation error."}},{"h":{"zh":"检查 2：高斯流","en":"Check 2: the Gaussian flow"},"p":{"zh":"用解析速度分别运行 Euler 与 Heun，比较终点与 2+0.5z。正文误差曲线来自这一计算。还检查解析轨迹的导数与速度表达式在若干时刻一致。","en":"Run Euler and Heun on the analytic velocity and compare the endpoint with 2+0.5z. The error curve of the main text comes from this computation. It is also checked that the derivative of the analytic trajectory agrees with the velocity expression at several times."}},{"h":{"zh":"检查 3：矩阵与优势","en":"Check 3: matrices and advantages"},"p":{"zh":"检查正矩阵经 Sinkhorn 迭代后的行列和与谱范数；用枚举的二动作 bandit 验证含自身组均值产生 (1−1/G) 比例。具体数值在末尾核验记录中列出。","en":"Check the row and column sums and the spectral norm of a positive matrix after Sinkhorn iteration; verify by enumerating a two-action bandit that a group mean including the sample itself yields the factor (1−1/G). The numbers are listed in the verification record."}}],"take":{"zh":"数值检查能抓住实现和代数错误，但不是一般数学定理的证明。","en":"Numerical checks catch errors of implementation and algebra; they are not proofs of general mathematical theorems."},"src":{"zh":"原创数值检查；随机种子 20261112。","en":"Original numerical checks; the notes used random seed 20261112."}},
    {"id":"L","part":"appendix","kind":"construct","math":["aL1","aL2"],"demo":"L","title":{"zh":"从读懂公式到提出问题","en":"From reading formulas to posing questions"},"lead":{"zh":"研究进阶阅读建议按依赖顺序推进，而不是按发布时间追逐术语。每一阶段都要留下一个推导、一张图和一个反例。","en":"For research-level reading, advance in order of dependency, not by chasing terms in order of release. Each stage should leave behind one derivation, one figure and one counter-example."},"secs":[{"h":{"zh":"阶段 1：优化与表征","en":"Stage 1: optimisation and representation"},"p":{"zh":"完成 SVD、条件期望投影、softmax 梯度与 Fisher 推导。自测：为何点积要缩放？LoRA 低秩约束的是哪个矩阵？参数重参数化怎样改变普通梯度？","en":"Complete the derivations of the SVD, the conditional-expectation projection, the softmax gradient and Fisher. Self-test: why must the dot product be scaled? Which matrix does LoRA’s low-rank constraint act on? How does reparametrising the parameters change the ordinary gradient?"}},{"h":{"zh":"阶段 2：生成与决策","en":"Stage 2: generation and decision"},"p":{"zh":"独立重推高斯 score、连续性方程、CFM、DPO 和组基线例子。自测：直线插值为什么能产生弯曲边缘流？为什么反向 SDE 与 ODE 的 score 系数差一半？","en":"Re-derive independently the Gaussian score, the continuity equation, CFM, DPO and the group-baseline example. Self-test: why can straight interpolation produce a curved marginal flow? Why do the score coefficients of the reverse SDE and the ODE differ by a half?"}},{"h":{"zh":"阶段 3：研究问题","en":"Stage 3: research questions"},"p":{"zh":"选一个窄问题，例如“有限样本下 OT 耦合是否降低求解误差”“Muon 对秩亏梯度是否放大噪声”“组标准化如何改变题目权重”。固定预算、基线与评价指标，再做可证伪实验。","en":"Pick one narrow question, such as “does an OT coupling lower solver error with finite samples”, “does Muon amplify noise for rank-deficient gradients”, or “how does group standardisation change the weight of each problem”. Fix the budget, the baselines and the metrics, then run a falsifiable experiment."}}],"take":{"zh":"掌握的标准：能重新推导、能写最小实验、能明确指出结论失效的条件。","en":"The standard for mastery: you can re-derive it, write the smallest experiment, and state exactly the conditions under which the conclusion fails."},"src":{"zh":"原创学习路线。","en":"Original learning route."}}
  );
})();
